WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.670
'I'll give you the cash
that Arjun gave you.'

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.550
'Similarly, ask him to return
the land that our father gave him.'

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:06.840
'He won't give it.'

00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:08.370
'But I'll make him return it.'

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.350
'I don't like this groom.'

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:12.920
'I like someone else.'

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.350
'Who is that guy?'

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:15.380
'Kiran.'

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:17.980
'No, Arjun, it's my mistake.'

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.340
'If I hadn't come to Chennai,
none of this would have happened.'

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:22.860
'She would have been
happy with her family.'

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.170
'Sid, Divi, let's go.'

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.880
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.340
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.750
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.920
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.540
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:08.250
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.770
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.000
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:21.130
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:23.230 --> 00:01:27.330
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:39.770
Bye.

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:43.340
I am Dr. Radhi's daughter.

00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:53.020
I know.

00:02:00.870 --> 00:02:01.780
How did you know?

00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:03.880
How long have you known?

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:05.950
Did Divi tell you?

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.250
No, Sid told me.

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:12.710
Grandpa.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:14.890
What do you want?

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.920
I don't understand
what's happening in our house.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:20.090
Mom and dad
are not talking to each other.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:23.500
Divi told me not to talk to Reena.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:26.960
Everyone is angry with Reena.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:30.550
Who? The girl who
came home this morning?

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.420
Yes.

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:35.130
Divi told me that
Reena is mom's daughter.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:42.500
I came to the hospital
to see you after that.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:46.920
You've known me all along.

00:02:48.090 --> 00:02:50.170
How can you talk to me like this?

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.170
What did you do to
get angry with you?

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:56.070
No.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:03:01.630
No one in that family talks to me
normally after they got to know.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.920
They don't like me.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.380
Including Dr. Radhi.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.250
Radhi is not angry with you.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:15.920
She remembers her
past when she sees you.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.530
She is very angry with her.

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:20.500
That's why she is
behaving like this.

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:24.750
Whatever it is.

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:28.250
I am very happy now.

00:03:29.090 --> 00:03:29.980
Why?

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:34.410
You know the truth
and not angry with me.

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:36.440
You are talking to me like this.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.220
That's why.

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.210
Shall I hug you once?

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.380
Okay.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.550
I'm leaving.

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.090
No.

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:16.250
I just came to know
that you know the truth.

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:19.170
Why are you leaving so soon?

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:22.210
I have some work in Bangalore.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:25.000
I will finish it and come back.

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:26.210
Okay?

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.340
God bless you..

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.380
Keep smiling.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.960
What are you doing?

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:03.210
You are creating
unnecessary problems.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:07.080
Why are you getting
attached to Reena?

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:09.750
Why did you take
the kids to the restaurant?

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:14.840
Finish your work and go home.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:18.000
I know everything.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:19.420
What do you know?

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:21.320
I know that Reena
is your daughter.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:29.460
Did she tell you?

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:30.730
No.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:32.670
She didn't tell me anything.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.610
She didn't tell me anything
when I brought her to this house.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:41.000
I tried to get her
to admit the truth.

00:05:42.550 --> 00:05:43.630
She didn't talk.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:45.840
You know that she
wouldn't have told me.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.740
But you are asking me like this.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.610
Why are you so angry with Reena?

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.960
Don't behave like this with Reena.

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:56.880
Don't do this.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:05:59.210
Why?

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.810
You are saying that it's not
right to be angry with Reena.

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.250
Didn't you know when you
asked me to leave her back then?

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:07.960
Was that right?

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.420
I don't need your help.

00:06:14.170 --> 00:06:16.300
Finish your work and go home.

00:06:16.860 --> 00:06:18.500
I will take care of my life.

00:06:19.630 --> 00:06:21.210
I don't need anyone's help.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:53.700
Sir.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:57.040
Nurses are staging
a strike outside.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:06:58.840
What?

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.000
There are no
nurses in the hospital.

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:18.580
What are you doing, Aruna?

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.510
What happened to you
that you are protesting?

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.890
Sir, we won't work.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:25.130
Aruna, whatever it is,
we can talk about it.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.340
All the patients need your care.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:29.170
So, please get back to work.

00:07:29.610 --> 00:07:31.990
Sir, even though we are
nurses, we are also humans.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.780
They are continuously
making us work overtime.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.320
They are also making
us do double shifts.

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:40.380
All the nurses here are
not sleeping or resting.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:42.380
They are getting
dehydrated and fainting.

00:07:42.820 --> 00:07:44.050
Amaya is not feeling well.

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:45.830
But she is working.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:47.820
Okay, Aruna.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.540
I will talk to Dr. Preetham
and solve everything. Okay?

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:51.750
Sir.

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:55.970
Every time we raise a complaint,
you say that you will talk to him.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.710
You say that there
won't be any problem.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.670
But nothing has changed here.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.050
When I spoke to Dr. Preetham

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:06.650
he said that nurses
are playing favourites.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.840
He said that even if we are not
here, doctors will run the hospital.

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:12.340
If we don't have
self-respect in the workplace

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:14.120
how can we
work in this environment?

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:15.420
When did this happen?

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:17.130
Why didn't you tell me about this?

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.880
Sir, what can we do
when he is the chief doctor?

00:08:20.570 --> 00:08:21.880
What do you want me to do, Aruna?

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:23.840
Sir, change the chief doctor.

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.920
Aruna, I can't change
the chief doctor so easily.

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:31.270
If he was an incapable
doctor, I am okay.

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:32.500
But he is one of the finest.

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.920
Sir, you appointed him
when Dr. Radhi was not here.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.170
Now, Dr. Radhi is here.

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:39.460
There was no problem
when she was here.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:41.880
What else, sir?
Change the chief doctor.

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.130
Aruna, she doesn't
have any problem.

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:45.380
Why does it bother you?

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:48.620
And she has come here saying
that she doesn't want any position.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:50.330
Sir, that's what she will say.

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.720
Sir, we need a person who considers

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:56.370
everyone's welfare
in this hospital.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:57.770
Only Dr. Radhi can do that.

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:01.230
You don't understand.
Even if Dr. Radhi wants to

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.290
we can't change
Dr. Preetham from that position.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:04.960
Because, we have an agreement.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.550
We don't know about that, sir.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:08.410
You have to bring
a solution to this problem.

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.170
Till then, none of us
will come to work, sir.

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:13.340
It's your call.
You have to decide it.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.960
I think all of you know the
reason for this emergency meeting.

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:29.190
The nurses are protesting.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:31.920
But nothing like this has
happened before, Arjun.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:34.850
All the staff working here
are working cooperatively.

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.090
All they ask is to reduce
the work time, right?

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:40.150
So, to reduce their
shift time accordingly

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:42.170
we can appoint some more nurses.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:43.300
Arun.

00:09:43.530 --> 00:09:44.420
Sir.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:46.050
Take that nurse entry sheet.
- Here, sir.

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:48.670
Take a look.
Look.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.600
Everyone is blaming me.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:53.840
In fact, I'm a friendly type.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:57.210
I keep telling everyone
to come to me. Why?

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.670
So that they directly talk to me
if such problems arise.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:02.380
But, sir..

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:05.290
They didn't raise
these complaints alone.

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:09.710
Whenever they complain, they
say that you don't respect them.

00:10:10.030 --> 00:10:11.580
And what do you
want to say about that?

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:16.080
No matter how many
complaints they raise

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:18.520
it's your job to handle
it patiently, right? - Arj..

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:25.250
Arjun. First, let's see what
we can do to stop the strike.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:26.670
Listen, Arjun.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:27.960
To be honest..

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.710
No one likes me here.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:33.550
That's why they target me
here, no matter what I do.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.220
Check it.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:38.870
All the nurses are working
eight-hour shifts only.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.710
Apart from that, one or two
nurses work overtime.

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:44.380
And I'm not forcing them.

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.880
All the doctors have
their favourite nurses.

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:50.670
I want them to treat the patients
whom they follow up.

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.670
I ask them if they can do it.

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.920
I ask them to do it
only if they can.

00:10:57.700 --> 00:11:00.460
I've never forced anyone to do it.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.130
Then why is
everyone saying it, sir?

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.250
Not everyone.

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.300
Aruna does it
for others all the time.

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:10.310
Apart from her, has Amaya or
the other nurses ever complained?

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.680
Right?

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:14.880
So, this is not a problem
for all the nurses.

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:17.040
It is Aruna's problem.
Please change her.

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:21.000
Sir, Aruna is one of our
senior experienced nurses.

00:11:21.580 --> 00:11:23.480
No one but Aruna knows
how to handle all the nurses

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:27.460
and how to run this hospital.
- So?

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:31.570
If we hire a new head nurse,
it will complicate the situation.

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:41.170
There's only one way
to control this situation.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:46.590
Like Reena said,
we need to appoint some nurses.

00:11:46.770 --> 00:11:49.460
Right.
- But temporarily.

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:52.350
If we increase the manpower

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.380
all the problems here
will be solved automatically.

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.750
Apart from that,
not only for the nurses..

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:04.460
There's a lot of work pressure
for the staff and the doctors.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:10.880
So, I'll appoint a psychologist
to give counselling to everyone.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:12.960
That is okay, Arjun.

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.800
But will the nurses listen to you?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:25.920
I'll talk to them.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.250
Mr. Arjun will come now.

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:35.840
Aruna.
- He's here.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:02.500
Look, a lot of patients need you
while you're on strike.

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:06.710
All the interns and doctors are
working extra because of you.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.090
Please continue your work.

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:13.050
We've sorted all the
complaints you've raised.

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.500
Ma'am, let it be sorted.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:18.640
Please take back your
position as the Chief Doctor.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:19.920
Are you kidding, Aruna?

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:23.630
What you're asking
is not that easy.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:28.340
In fact, Dr. Preetham was taking
good care for the past two months.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.040
There were no issues then.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:32.040
The hospital
didn't face any issues.

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:34.650
Ma'am, it was better
when you were here.

00:13:35.070 --> 00:13:35.920
What do you mean?

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:39.190
The interns took a lot
of time to adapt to me.

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:41.460
They struggled a lot to
understand my work style.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:45.210
Dr. Preetham has been
here for just two months.

00:13:45.730 --> 00:13:47.590
Will everything be fine
as soon as he's here?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.290
Dr. Preetham is not a new intern.

00:13:52.590 --> 00:13:54.210
He's a senior, experienced doctor.

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:58.210
He has worked
in a lot of places like this.

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:01.060
Is it right for you
to not adapt to him?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:04.880
And what is your problem?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:09.380
It's just an extra shift
and extra time.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:11.460
We've solved that.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:12.770
Please get back to work.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.510
I can see that
everyone is stressed.

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:24.470
Arjun is going to appoint
a new psychologist

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.960
for all the staff,
nurses and doctors.

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:29.960
Come on, guys.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:33.590
If this happens again,
I'll strike along with you.

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:36.540
And now, please get back to work.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:49.840
Okay, let's go.
- Let's get back to work.

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:52.380
Dr. Radhi will help us.
- Yes.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:56.570
Okay, let's go.
- Let's get back to work.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:05.750
Don't worry, Aruna.
I'll take care.

00:15:09.320 --> 00:15:11.840
Arjun, appoint a psychologist soon.

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:13.130
Okay, ma'am.

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:22.090
Kiran, luckily..

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:23.920
We've solved the
nurses' problem.

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.080
Or else, Dr. Preetham
would've given us nurses' uniform

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:29.580
and made us work
as both interns and nurses.

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:30.600
I..

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:35.000
Hey..

00:15:35.840 --> 00:15:36.750
I'm talking to you.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:37.910
Why are you ignoring me?

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:39.630
What did I ask you?

00:15:39.900 --> 00:15:41.420
What?
- A date with Reena.

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:44.830
You're not even talking about it.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:46.800
Is this nurse problem
important now?

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.770
Hey! Nurses' problem is
important in such a big hospital.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:51.780
Is your date with Reena
so important?

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:54.880
I stopped your engagement
when you called me, right?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:55.780
I deserve this.

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:57.690
Sir, show me your face.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:58.920
Did you stop it?

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:00.090
I stopped it.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.730
I came when you called me.

00:16:02.630 --> 00:16:03.510
As if.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:05.710
I asked you to hit my dad.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:06.700
Did you hit him?

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:08.590
I don't care.

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:10.090
Can you help me or not?

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:13.090
Reena..
One minute.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:16.880
That date..

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:18.500
Which date?

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.440
I asked you if I can
go on a date with you.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:22.920
You said you'll come with me.

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:24.230
Oh, that one.

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.880
Whatever it is, let's have
coffee in the canteen and talk.

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:28.880
Okay?

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.340
Coffee in the canteen?

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:34.330
Let's go out and talk.

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.960
Out?
I have a lot of work.

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:41.320
Reena, I'm warning you.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:44.090
If you don't come with me now

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:46.550
I'll cry.

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.020
Reena, please.

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:49.990
I just want to know about you.

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.960
I'm not such an experienced doctor.
Why are you troubling me?

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:54.590
Are you coming or not?

00:16:56.420 --> 00:16:57.340
Okay, I'll come.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:16:59.010
When?

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:00.820
Tomorrow.

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:01.880
I have work today.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:03.300
Is tomorrow okay?

00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:05.460
Who are you asking?

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:07.840
I'm asking my conscience.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.130
You're coming, right?

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:11.500
You won't change, right?

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:13.960
Right.
See you tomorrow.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:15.670
Don't look at me.
Do your work.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.320
Here.

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:23.730
Drink slowly.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.380
Hello, sir.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.860
She is completely stable.
And this is the right time.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:34.710
If we do the surgery as planned,
there won't be any problem.

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:36.180
Okay, Doctor.

00:17:38.560 --> 00:17:42.420
And this time, Dr. Reena
will be with me for the surgery.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.710
But last time, Dr. Anitha
assisted you, right?

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:48.750
Yeah.
- Why are you changing the team?

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:52.050
Yes, sir.
Anitha has a lot of cases now.

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.590
In fact, Dr. Reena
is a fine doctor too.

00:17:54.790 --> 00:17:55.840
You don't worry.

00:17:56.270 --> 00:17:58.050
Even if she is the finest doctor

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:00.420
I have faith in the old team.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.000
Let Reena do it.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:07.650
Dr. Reena came to me day and
night and took good care of me.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:10.090
Sometimes, even
if the nurse forgets

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:13.230
she gave me medicines
and took good care of me.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:15.090
That's her duty.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:17.250
But she took care
of me sincerely.

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.990
If Dr. Reena and Dr. Radhi are
with me in the operation theatre

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.550
I will be brave and fearless.

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:30.550
Okay, proceed.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.250
We could have discussed it at home.

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:40.750
Why did you bring me here?

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.880
After I spoke at home

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:46.410
is your wife brainwashing
you to Arjun's side?

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:49.960
Okay.
Tell me what it is.

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:54.080
It's time for me
to go to the hospital.

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:56.920
How will you go?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:00.270
There is a problem with
the nurses in the hospital.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:01.240
Do you know that?

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:03.360
Yes.

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:05.380
I heard about that problem too.

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.500
But Radhi solved it, right?

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:09.340
The problem is solved.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:12.960
But do you know what is
the solution to that problem?

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:14.090
What?

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:17.920
They have decided to appoint
a psychologist in the hospital.

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:20.650
If a psychologist
works in RK Hospital

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:22.700
isn't it good for the
people who work there?

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:26.340
Hey, did you get
confused along with them?

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.920
Why are you talking unnecessarily?

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:30.630
What's your point?

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:33.000
Do you know what I have studied?

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.590
I am a leading
psychologist in Bangalore.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:39.960
Okay. How do you know
that they will select you?

00:19:41.350 --> 00:19:42.200
Look.

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:45.300
I will be the psychologist
in that hospital.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.630
I passed out of CIP Ranchi
with flying colours.

00:19:48.190 --> 00:19:50.310
Is it a big deal for me
to enter the hospital?

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:52.210
Look.

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:54.440
I don't know what you are doing.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:56.290
But I stand by what I said.

00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:59.750
I am not going to help
you in any way. - I know..

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.630
I am not stupid.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.920
I know that you won't help me.

00:20:04.040 --> 00:20:05.920
But I came to tell you my plans.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:08.930
If you want to expose my plan

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:10.670
I will expose you.

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.490
Everyone there knows about me.

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:14.960
How will you expose me?

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:16.380
Simple.

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:18.960
I will say that you
asked me to do all this.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:23.170
I will say that you are the
mastermind behind all this.

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:28.000
I know what kind of an image
you have in that hospital.

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:32.120
So, will those people
believe me? Or you?

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:37.820
I hope you won't
do anything stupid

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.340
to prove yourself
or to save the hospital.

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:42.630
Just watch my play.

00:21:48.713 --> 00:21:51.783
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:21:53.853 --> 00:21:56.323
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:21:58.853 --> 00:22:01.653
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:22:03.593 --> 00:22:05.843
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:22:06.043 --> 00:22:08.423
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:22:08.553 --> 00:22:11.053
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:22:11.343 --> 00:22:13.843
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:22:16.303 --> 00:22:19.143
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:22:21.493 --> 00:22:24.063
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:22:26.123 --> 00:22:30.393
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:22:42.833 --> 00:22:44.783
He is sleeping
after drinking in the morning.

00:22:45.213 --> 00:22:47.093
I am fed up of him.

00:22:47.203 --> 00:22:50.483
I don't know who opened
the wine shop for you.

00:22:50.543 --> 00:22:51.403
Get up.

00:22:51.513 --> 00:22:53.203
Hey, get up.
- Get lost.

00:22:53.643 --> 00:22:54.813
I can't stand him.

00:23:12.133 --> 00:23:13.263
Drink some water.

00:23:17.733 --> 00:23:19.073
She is too lazy
to get the water herself.

00:23:21.643 --> 00:23:23.053
Why is there blood on your hands?

00:23:23.843 --> 00:23:24.683
It's nothing.

00:23:24.873 --> 00:23:26.423
You're bleeding,
how could you say nothing?

00:23:26.543 --> 00:23:27.423
Forget it.

00:23:28.503 --> 00:23:29.753
Did you go to the hospital?

00:23:29.943 --> 00:23:31.113
It's nothing, I am fine.

00:23:31.553 --> 00:23:32.753
I am getting late for work.

00:23:33.103 --> 00:23:33.923
I have to leave.

00:23:35.173 --> 00:23:37.753
But how can I let you go
if you are coughing like this?

00:23:38.493 --> 00:23:41.503
No, Mom. If I go and check now,
they will say that I am sick.

00:23:41.613 --> 00:23:42.843
They will ask me to get admitted.

00:23:43.113 --> 00:23:44.703
Then I can't go to work.

00:23:44.863 --> 00:23:46.853
And I will get only
half the salary.

00:23:47.103 --> 00:23:48.423
Is that even a reason?

00:23:49.573 --> 00:23:51.923
My current salary is not enough.

00:23:52.193 --> 00:23:54.643
If I get admitted now,
it will cost me.

00:23:54.773 --> 00:23:55.913
I will get it checked.

00:23:56.023 --> 00:23:56.873
But not now.

00:23:57.073 --> 00:23:58.053
I'll do it later.

00:23:58.433 --> 00:24:00.633
At least if Abhi goes to work,
it will be helpful to you.

00:24:01.373 --> 00:24:02.413
It's not like that, Mom.

00:24:02.813 --> 00:24:04.703
My salary is enough
to handle the problems now.

00:24:05.213 --> 00:24:09.423
If Abhi goes to work now,
it will cost me more.

00:24:09.603 --> 00:24:11.083
There is no solution for this, Mom.

00:24:22.913 --> 00:24:24.383
Okay, Mom.
I will leave.

00:24:29.243 --> 00:24:31.043
My grandpa hugged me
before leaving.

00:24:32.303 --> 00:24:35.263
Don't ask everything over the
phone. I will tell you in person.

00:24:35.793 --> 00:24:36.653
Hey, Reena.

00:24:38.003 --> 00:24:38.853
Did you ask?

00:24:39.893 --> 00:24:43.053
What do you mean?
Be more specific.

00:24:43.963 --> 00:24:45.963
Everyone is talking to me
like this these days.

00:24:47.403 --> 00:24:49.423
I guess I was too excited
to ask it properly.

00:24:50.163 --> 00:24:51.713
Did you ask who your father is?

00:24:55.263 --> 00:24:57.433
Why are you asking
about him all of a sudden?

00:24:57.733 --> 00:24:58.863
All of a sudden?

00:24:59.243 --> 00:25:00.383
What do you mean?

00:25:02.003 --> 00:25:03.963
You said Thyagarajan
knows who you are..

00:25:04.393 --> 00:25:05.303
Yes, I said.

00:25:06.063 --> 00:25:08.023
Did you ask who your father is?
You could have asked.

00:25:08.203 --> 00:25:09.303
I didn't ask him.
- Why?

00:25:13.013 --> 00:25:17.253
If someone gets close to me,
they leave me quickly.

00:25:17.533 --> 00:25:19.303
Okay, don't ask about your father.

00:25:20.083 --> 00:25:21.593
You could've asked him
about your mother.

00:25:22.493 --> 00:25:25.843
You must have many questions,
including why she abandoned you.

00:25:26.593 --> 00:25:27.463
Why should I ask that?

00:25:27.703 --> 00:25:28.803
Everyone wants to know.

00:25:29.223 --> 00:25:30.213
Especially you.

00:25:32.263 --> 00:25:33.183
Look here.

00:25:34.393 --> 00:25:36.003
Only three people know about it.

00:25:37.343 --> 00:25:39.463
Radhi, Thyagarajan and you.

00:25:39.943 --> 00:25:41.963
You were a young girl.
There is no way you would know.

00:25:42.733 --> 00:25:44.133
Radhi won't tell me.

00:25:44.973 --> 00:25:47.173
Why don't you ask Thyagarajan?
He would tell you.

00:25:50.713 --> 00:25:51.583
No, Uncle.

00:25:52.023 --> 00:25:52.863
I don't want that.

00:25:53.683 --> 00:25:55.003
I thought I could help you.

00:25:55.533 --> 00:25:56.753
If you don't like it, fine.

00:25:56.783 --> 00:25:58.423
Why are you taking so much
time to bring the clothes?

00:25:58.523 --> 00:26:00.253
I am coming! She is calling me.

00:26:11.113 --> 00:26:12.893
Bless you, dear.
Take care.

00:26:15.263 --> 00:26:17.213
Bye, Grandpa.
- Bye.

00:26:18.333 --> 00:26:19.153
Sid, let's go.

00:26:25.183 --> 00:26:26.003
Dude.

00:26:27.813 --> 00:26:30.713
Hi.
- Mom scolded grandpa and sent him.

00:26:31.413 --> 00:26:33.213
Why?
- I don't know, dude.

00:26:35.903 --> 00:26:37.603
Do you have grandpa's number?

00:26:38.323 --> 00:26:42.553
Tell me.
- 950.. - Sid.

00:26:44.033 --> 00:26:45.773
You don't have to tell her
anyone's number.

00:26:46.653 --> 00:26:47.633
Come.

00:27:01.473 --> 00:27:02.963
Poor girl.

00:27:03.573 --> 00:27:04.923
Bad luck.

00:27:05.883 --> 00:27:07.883
You are the reason for all this.

00:27:08.273 --> 00:27:10.543
What's with the sudden disrespect?

00:27:10.633 --> 00:27:11.553
Get lost.

00:27:12.603 --> 00:27:13.463
Get lost?

00:27:23.723 --> 00:27:24.633
Madam.

00:27:26.203 --> 00:27:27.063
Doctor.

00:27:35.903 --> 00:27:38.703
Nurse, bring 100 ml of painkiller.
Bring Emeset also.

00:27:38.753 --> 00:27:39.993
Okay, Doctor.
- Mom?

00:27:40.913 --> 00:27:42.213
What are you doing here?

00:27:42.333 --> 00:27:44.383
Guna, your mom is
suffering from stomach pain.

00:27:44.503 --> 00:27:45.973
There are no doctors
available except me.

00:27:46.033 --> 00:27:48.113
Nurse, you could have called me.
Why did you call her?

00:27:48.383 --> 00:27:49.233
Give it to me.

00:27:49.703 --> 00:27:50.633
Mom.

00:27:50.823 --> 00:27:51.643
Mom.

00:27:51.893 --> 00:27:53.093
I am here.
Leave.

00:27:53.243 --> 00:27:54.343
Don't be stupid, Guna.

00:27:56.253 --> 00:27:58.943
Teju.
What happened?

00:27:59.143 --> 00:28:01.123
Ma'am, according
to the latest report

00:28:01.243 --> 00:28:03.763
her cervical cancer has
reached the metastatic stage.

00:28:03.843 --> 00:28:06.503
It has spread to her lungs,
stomach and nose.

00:28:06.863 --> 00:28:08.673
That's why she is
suffering from stomach pain.

00:28:08.793 --> 00:28:10.453
So I have given her
some painkillers.

00:28:11.013 --> 00:28:11.883
Good.

00:28:13.143 --> 00:28:13.993
Guna.

00:28:14.043 --> 00:28:16.923
I heard you screaming
at Teju to stop.

00:28:17.333 --> 00:28:20.173
See. Whatever it is,
control your emotions.

00:28:27.963 --> 00:28:28.963
Hey, move.

00:28:29.253 --> 00:28:31.813
Mom..

00:28:33.743 --> 00:28:34.713
Jenifer..

00:28:35.133 --> 00:28:36.173
How are you feeling now?

00:28:38.383 --> 00:28:39.383
Now, better.

00:28:45.003 --> 00:28:47.133
I want to talk to you in private.

00:29:00.783 --> 00:29:01.713
Tell me.

00:29:03.793 --> 00:29:07.173
I know my condition
is getting worse.

00:29:09.293 --> 00:29:10.173
But..

00:29:11.003 --> 00:29:13.923
I want to perform
Bharatanatyam for my son.

00:29:14.883 --> 00:29:15.763
At least..

00:29:16.083 --> 00:29:18.503
I want to dance
for at least 30 seconds.

00:29:20.003 --> 00:29:22.713
As soon as possible.

00:29:26.023 --> 00:29:26.843
Until then..

00:29:28.563 --> 00:29:33.143
Please make sure
that I don't die before that.

00:29:34.613 --> 00:29:35.503
Please.

00:29:36.413 --> 00:29:40.883
See, you should have to undergo
chemotherapy for your condition.

00:29:41.403 --> 00:29:43.503
But since you refused any treatment

00:29:44.033 --> 00:29:45.753
we make sure
that you don't have any pain.

00:29:46.203 --> 00:29:47.883
When you are in this condition

00:29:49.813 --> 00:29:51.163
and you say you want to dance

00:29:52.113 --> 00:29:54.253
I don't know how to take it.

00:29:55.303 --> 00:29:56.153
I understand.

00:29:57.423 --> 00:29:59.753
Even if my body doesn't cooperate

00:30:00.783 --> 00:30:01.613
as a mother

00:30:02.713 --> 00:30:04.553
I can do this for my son.

00:30:06.593 --> 00:30:07.753
Please help me.

00:30:08.273 --> 00:30:09.173
Please.

00:30:32.493 --> 00:30:34.553
Are you searching for someone?
- No.

00:30:34.773 --> 00:30:36.143
I am not searching for anyone.

00:30:36.263 --> 00:30:38.633
The ambience is good here.
I'm looking at that.

00:30:39.323 --> 00:30:40.213
Say something.

00:30:41.333 --> 00:30:42.543
Please order something.

00:30:46.963 --> 00:30:47.813
Come soon.

00:30:48.563 --> 00:30:49.413
Who should come?

00:30:52.633 --> 00:30:53.843
I just want a coffee.

00:30:54.373 --> 00:30:55.193
Coffee?

00:30:55.413 --> 00:30:57.173
They will bring it soon.
- What?

00:30:57.533 --> 00:30:58.703
No, brunch.

00:30:59.003 --> 00:31:00.093
They serve a good brunch here.

00:31:00.343 --> 00:31:01.213
Try it.

00:31:01.843 --> 00:31:02.883
You order something.

00:31:04.753 --> 00:31:05.803
I will do it.

00:31:09.443 --> 00:31:10.383
What is this?

00:31:15.323 --> 00:31:16.713
Are you studying for the NEET exam?

00:31:16.983 --> 00:31:18.553
How long will you take
to scan those two pages?

00:31:22.083 --> 00:31:23.423
What do you want to discuss?

00:31:23.773 --> 00:31:26.473
What do I want to discuss?

00:31:27.253 --> 00:31:29.493
There is a patient.
I want to discuss a patient.

00:31:29.603 --> 00:31:32.103
I want to discuss a case.
- Hey.

00:31:32.963 --> 00:31:34.633
You brought me here
to talk about me.

00:31:35.093 --> 00:31:36.003
Yes.

00:31:36.743 --> 00:31:37.633
Correct.

00:31:39.633 --> 00:31:41.133
Your behaviour is not good.

00:31:42.043 --> 00:31:43.053
You are sharp.

00:31:47.223 --> 00:31:48.923
He is not here yet.

00:31:49.423 --> 00:31:50.483
Who should come?

00:31:50.923 --> 00:31:52.503
Waiter..

00:31:52.713 --> 00:31:54.343
I can cover everything
only if he comes here.

00:31:54.623 --> 00:31:56.303
I mean, to place the order.

00:32:00.213 --> 00:32:01.553
Ma'am, your order, please.

00:32:01.643 --> 00:32:03.003
Two coffee.

00:32:03.053 --> 00:32:04.553
Bring it piping hot.

00:32:05.003 --> 00:32:06.133
Okay.
- Bring it.

00:32:06.933 --> 00:32:08.843
Is this why you took so long
to read the menu?

00:32:09.773 --> 00:32:12.003
Why are you asking
so many questions?

00:32:12.173 --> 00:32:14.383
There's something going on.
Tell me the truth.

00:32:14.563 --> 00:32:15.673
Why did you bring me here?

00:32:17.303 --> 00:32:18.843
Sorry, Reena.

00:32:19.153 --> 00:32:20.303
I will tell you the truth.

00:32:20.693 --> 00:32:23.423
Kiran asked me to bring you here.

00:32:24.183 --> 00:32:25.113
For a date.

00:32:25.993 --> 00:32:27.943
I had asked him for a favour.

00:32:28.213 --> 00:32:29.633
He helped me in return.

00:32:29.843 --> 00:32:31.463
Don't blabber.

00:32:32.193 --> 00:32:33.093
Darn..

00:32:33.673 --> 00:32:36.673
He helped me.
I have to help him in return..

00:32:37.593 --> 00:32:39.803
Is this how you help him?
By being a matchmaker?

00:32:39.993 --> 00:32:44.893
No, I am a wing-woman. Kiran said
that I am like his co-partner.

00:32:46.093 --> 00:32:47.003
You..

00:32:51.413 --> 00:32:52.253
Hey, Nilofer.

00:32:53.293 --> 00:32:54.133
Reena.

00:32:55.453 --> 00:32:56.843
Oh, my God.
What a surprise!

00:32:57.853 --> 00:32:59.983
'You will be the one
who gets surprised.'

00:33:02.053 --> 00:33:02.923
Kiran.

00:33:03.383 --> 00:33:05.453
We didn't expect you here.

00:33:05.643 --> 00:33:06.883
Why don't you join us?
- Sure.

00:33:06.963 --> 00:33:08.093
Yeah, come..

00:33:13.323 --> 00:33:14.713
Ma'am, coffee.

00:33:18.543 --> 00:33:20.553
Actually, I am a regular
at this cafe.

00:33:20.983 --> 00:33:22.383
This is my hangout spot.

00:33:22.923 --> 00:33:24.673
How about you?
Do you both come here often?

00:33:26.233 --> 00:33:28.843
Hey, don't overact.

00:33:29.133 --> 00:33:30.173
The coffee is very hot.

00:33:30.433 --> 00:33:31.713
She might throw it on your face.

00:33:34.053 --> 00:33:35.053
You ordered coffee?

00:33:35.613 --> 00:33:36.673
You could have
ordered something else.

00:33:37.133 --> 00:33:38.213
You always drink this.

00:33:38.463 --> 00:33:40.753
Actually, I like the food here.
- Why do you want to date me?

00:33:44.793 --> 00:33:45.683
Sorry.

00:33:46.033 --> 00:33:48.383
She was glaring at me,
I got scared.

00:33:49.133 --> 00:33:50.233
So I spilled everything.

00:33:52.003 --> 00:33:54.423
Kiran, I am not
interested in dating.

00:33:54.703 --> 00:33:55.843
Work is my priority now.

00:33:56.013 --> 00:33:57.473
Concentrate on your work.

00:33:57.703 --> 00:33:59.633
Don't get involved
in unnecessary things.

00:34:04.303 --> 00:34:05.133
He will scold me now.

00:34:07.993 --> 00:34:08.883
I'll do one thing.

00:34:09.353 --> 00:34:13.213
The guy who ran away..
I'll ask him to marry you.

00:34:17.613 --> 00:34:18.843
Oh, no, dear..

00:34:19.873 --> 00:34:21.633
Doctor..

00:34:21.923 --> 00:34:22.963
What happened?

00:34:23.883 --> 00:34:26.173
He was sitting on the bed
after coming back from work.

00:34:26.673 --> 00:34:27.803
He fell down suddenly.

00:34:32.433 --> 00:34:34.253
It's definitely a stroke.
When did it happen?

00:34:34.493 --> 00:34:35.423
It's been an hour.

00:34:35.823 --> 00:34:36.843
Fortunately,
it's only been an hour.

00:34:37.093 --> 00:34:38.083
We can reverse it.

00:34:38.243 --> 00:34:40.303
Naveen, shift him to the ICU

00:34:40.673 --> 00:34:42.673
and start
the thrombolysis immediately.

00:34:42.723 --> 00:34:44.503
Sure, sir
- Move. Push him.

00:34:45.633 --> 00:34:46.453
Thank you.

00:34:49.473 --> 00:34:52.173
I am so sorry.
- I should have been careful.

00:34:52.413 --> 00:34:53.253
I am sorry.

00:34:57.883 --> 00:34:59.183
Are you alright?
- Nothing.

00:34:59.403 --> 00:35:01.753
Sorry, I made you spill the tea.

00:35:01.973 --> 00:35:04.193
I'll buy one for you.
- It's okay. I'll take care of it.

00:35:04.773 --> 00:35:05.713
Two cups of tea.

00:35:06.443 --> 00:35:07.343
Take away?

00:35:08.683 --> 00:35:10.313
No, I'll have it here.

00:35:10.903 --> 00:35:12.843
Then, let's have it together.

00:35:17.203 --> 00:35:18.753
Are you a tea person?

00:35:20.223 --> 00:35:21.053
Yes.

00:35:21.903 --> 00:35:23.803
But I drink coffee also.

00:35:25.673 --> 00:35:26.633
You talk well.

00:35:27.163 --> 00:35:28.633
Do you come here often?

00:35:30.593 --> 00:35:32.213
I have come here many times.
- Is it?

00:35:32.523 --> 00:35:34.343
I have never seen you before.

00:35:35.753 --> 00:35:38.343
Maybe, you would have
missed me in the crowd.

00:35:38.763 --> 00:35:39.823
How is that possible?

00:35:40.293 --> 00:35:43.753
How can I miss someone
who is so tall, fit and handsome?

00:35:46.073 --> 00:35:47.173
You talk well.

00:35:49.003 --> 00:35:50.673
What do you do?

00:35:51.163 --> 00:35:52.063
Me?

00:35:53.003 --> 00:35:53.923
Come closer.

00:35:57.313 --> 00:35:59.123
Actually, I am jobless.

00:35:59.443 --> 00:36:00.383
I am looking for a job.

00:36:03.073 --> 00:36:05.463
IT?
- No. Why do you ask that?

00:36:05.993 --> 00:36:10.413
Generally, people in IT switch
jobs often. That's why I asked.

00:36:11.053 --> 00:36:11.983
Yes.

00:36:12.803 --> 00:36:14.593
But I am a psychologist
from Bangalore.

00:36:16.713 --> 00:36:17.603
Oh.

00:36:19.983 --> 00:36:20.963
Superb.

00:36:21.213 --> 00:36:22.503
But I am looking for a job.

00:36:27.073 --> 00:36:28.053
Manasa.

00:36:29.463 --> 00:36:30.253
Arjun.

00:36:32.413 --> 00:36:33.303
Reena.

00:36:34.213 --> 00:36:35.883
I am going
to perform Ganga's surgery.

00:36:36.163 --> 00:36:38.203
You have to assist me, okay?

00:36:43.263 --> 00:36:45.893
Mr. Rajendar is a board
member of this hospital.

00:36:45.963 --> 00:36:48.213
So, he insisted me
to get involved in this.

00:36:48.763 --> 00:36:51.053
I have spoken to Arjun
and Dr. Preetham

00:36:51.413 --> 00:36:52.423
I didn't say anything.

00:36:53.193 --> 00:36:55.383
Don't think that I planned
to perform this surgery.

00:36:56.433 --> 00:36:58.303
No, I didn't think like that.

00:37:06.623 --> 00:37:08.863
So, you are going to perform
the surgery along with her.

00:37:09.833 --> 00:37:11.903
Yes.
Weren't you listening?

00:37:13.013 --> 00:37:13.843
I was.

00:37:14.433 --> 00:37:16.883
But you don't seem
to be interested in this.

00:37:17.423 --> 00:37:20.843
Go and tell her that you
don't want to work on this case.

00:37:21.213 --> 00:37:22.463
When did I say that?

00:37:23.003 --> 00:37:25.383
You don't seem very interested.

00:37:27.753 --> 00:37:28.923
Don't get me started, Aruna.

00:37:29.373 --> 00:37:32.713
Either I get angry
and fight with her.

00:37:33.343 --> 00:37:34.963
Or she gets angry with me.

00:37:35.723 --> 00:37:37.253
This keeps happening
back and forth.

00:37:37.843 --> 00:37:40.713
Only when there is
a case or a surgery like this

00:37:41.093 --> 00:37:43.003
am I able to talk to her normally.

00:37:44.353 --> 00:37:45.963
Even if not as mother and daughter

00:37:46.363 --> 00:37:50.093
I used to be able
to talk to her as a student.

00:37:51.013 --> 00:37:52.243
Why are you trying to ruin that?

00:37:53.613 --> 00:37:56.343
So, you are happy
to assist Dr. Radhi.

00:37:56.943 --> 00:37:57.753
Definitely.

00:37:58.123 --> 00:37:59.133
I am very happy.

00:37:59.523 --> 00:38:02.003
But your face is
saying the opposite.

00:38:03.023 --> 00:38:06.713
My face has become like this
because of everyone's comments.

00:38:07.753 --> 00:38:08.633
But, Aruna..

00:38:09.073 --> 00:38:10.833
If anything goes
wrong with this case

00:38:11.473 --> 00:38:13.633
I don't know
if Dr. Preetham will support me.

00:38:14.023 --> 00:38:17.053
But if Dr. Radhi is here,
she will definitely support me.

00:38:30.343 --> 00:38:33.383
If I want to sit alone,
I can sit elsewhere.

00:38:33.683 --> 00:38:34.653
I want to talk to you.

00:38:35.363 --> 00:38:36.253
Sit.

00:38:37.023 --> 00:38:38.123
I don't want to talk to you.

00:38:38.413 --> 00:38:39.503
You don't have to talk.

00:38:39.783 --> 00:38:40.883
Just listen to me.

00:38:41.803 --> 00:38:42.633
Sit.

00:38:47.943 --> 00:38:49.003
What is your problem?

00:38:49.613 --> 00:38:51.173
Arjun, Dr. Radhi and
others have accepted me.

00:38:51.733 --> 00:38:53.253
In fact, I am working
with Dr. Radhi now.

00:38:54.343 --> 00:38:55.663
Everyone who was
involved in that case

00:38:55.683 --> 00:38:57.003
has forgotten that
and accepted me.

00:38:58.313 --> 00:38:59.253
In spite of that

00:38:59.863 --> 00:39:00.913
why are you angry with me?

00:39:02.223 --> 00:39:03.843
Your mother is suffering inside.

00:39:04.253 --> 00:39:06.383
But you are telling me
not to touch her.

00:39:07.273 --> 00:39:08.983
If I was not there, your mother's
condition will be different.

00:39:09.063 --> 00:39:10.563
You know that, right?
- Hey, Teju.

00:39:11.563 --> 00:39:12.503
I am not done yet.

00:39:13.963 --> 00:39:15.923
How long will you be angry?

00:39:16.723 --> 00:39:18.173
You don't have any other option.

00:39:18.393 --> 00:39:21.053
There will be many situations
where we have to work together.

00:39:21.923 --> 00:39:23.703
If you behave like this then

00:39:24.083 --> 00:39:25.593
it is a risk
for the patient's life.

00:39:26.113 --> 00:39:27.593
We can't work properly.

00:39:28.003 --> 00:39:28.873
Oh!

00:39:29.813 --> 00:39:31.423
Will the patient's life be at risk?

00:39:33.653 --> 00:39:34.553
Guna!

00:39:37.593 --> 00:39:42.133
I can see who you are when
you accuse me of that one thing.

00:39:44.043 --> 00:39:44.903
Look at me.

00:39:46.383 --> 00:39:48.503
I know many things
that others don't know.

00:39:49.793 --> 00:39:51.403
But I'm pretending to be ignorant.

00:39:52.903 --> 00:39:54.253
Do you want a sample?

00:39:54.683 --> 00:39:55.523
What sample?

00:39:55.723 --> 00:39:58.463
Who do you think leaked
those internal affairs?

00:40:01.063 --> 00:40:01.923
Me?

00:40:02.463 --> 00:40:03.323
No.

00:40:04.113 --> 00:40:04.963
It was Naveen.

00:40:07.803 --> 00:40:08.633
Firstly..

00:40:09.263 --> 00:40:11.303
I am not saying this
to turn you against Naveen.

00:40:12.503 --> 00:40:17.123
I am saying this to reduce
the distance between the two of us.

00:40:17.423 --> 00:40:18.653
Oh.
- Secondly..

00:40:19.593 --> 00:40:24.343
You shouldn't tell this
to Naveen or anyone else.

00:40:24.733 --> 00:40:26.983
Why?
- If you say that

00:40:27.633 --> 00:40:30.903
I will tell everyone in this
hospital about you and Anitha.

00:40:32.923 --> 00:40:34.213
Is it a rumour?

00:40:35.923 --> 00:40:39.693
If someone saw you and Anitha
kissing in the wardroom

00:40:39.813 --> 00:40:41.043
how will it be a rumour?

00:40:44.283 --> 00:40:45.213
It's not, right?

00:40:47.003 --> 00:40:47.923
It's not.

00:41:55.663 --> 00:41:58.753
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:42:00.793 --> 00:42:03.123
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:42:05.813 --> 00:42:08.533
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:42:10.463 --> 00:42:12.853
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:42:12.953 --> 00:42:15.373
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:42:15.483 --> 00:42:17.943
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:42:18.393 --> 00:42:20.933
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:42:23.413 --> 00:42:26.063
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:42:28.443 --> 00:42:30.943
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:42:33.173 --> 00:42:37.523
♪ In it, I am also a doctor ♪

00:42:49.473 --> 00:42:51.323
It was wrong to ask me
to come so early in the morning.

00:42:51.373 --> 00:42:53.103
It is worse to make me wait now.

00:42:56.453 --> 00:42:57.283
Reena.

00:42:57.933 --> 00:42:58.813
Reena.

00:42:59.453 --> 00:43:00.483
I am angry with you.

00:43:00.933 --> 00:43:01.853
So what?

00:43:03.343 --> 00:43:05.523
You shouldn't have
spoken to Kiran like that.

00:43:05.823 --> 00:43:06.653
Why?

00:43:07.553 --> 00:43:09.773
He got really upset
after you spoke to him that way.

00:43:10.143 --> 00:43:13.143
How dare you take me on a date
just because he asked you to.

00:43:13.503 --> 00:43:15.043
It was just a date.

00:43:15.113 --> 00:43:16.823
Did he say that he loves you?

00:43:17.103 --> 00:43:18.413
He just asked you out for a coffee.

00:43:18.683 --> 00:43:20.133
This is how everything starts.

00:43:21.013 --> 00:43:25.363
He wanted you to know about him more
than he wanted to know about you.

00:43:25.513 --> 00:43:28.183
That's why he kept talking to you.

00:43:32.603 --> 00:43:34.183
You are making a scene.

00:43:34.223 --> 00:43:36.393
I can't go on a date
because of his feelings.

00:43:36.723 --> 00:43:38.233
Don't support him and talk to me.

00:43:40.933 --> 00:43:42.103
Talk to everyone like this.

00:43:42.873 --> 00:43:44.063
You look like a monkey.

00:43:45.353 --> 00:43:46.523
I said it won't look good.

00:43:51.663 --> 00:43:52.893
Why did you come for practice?

00:43:53.283 --> 00:43:54.423
You are not feeling well.

00:43:55.563 --> 00:43:57.813
You should have asked
switched places and taken rest.

00:43:58.893 --> 00:44:00.353
The strike just ended.

00:44:01.383 --> 00:44:02.273
Let it be, Aruna.

00:44:02.633 --> 00:44:04.113
Let's do it for Dr. Guna.

00:44:04.463 --> 00:44:05.713
Everyone is doing it.

00:44:06.083 --> 00:44:07.143
Let me also do something.

00:44:08.983 --> 00:44:10.023
Hi, guys.

00:44:15.663 --> 00:44:16.893
Guys, this is the song.

00:44:17.113 --> 00:44:18.323
Guna loves this song.

00:44:18.613 --> 00:44:21.233
We are going to practice this
song and dance with Mrs. Jenifer.

00:44:21.763 --> 00:44:23.643
But how do we learn?

00:44:24.073 --> 00:44:25.953
I will share the video.

00:44:26.043 --> 00:44:27.483
Everyone can watch and practice.

00:44:27.503 --> 00:44:30.313
Senior, watching this?
We can't learn from this.

00:44:30.393 --> 00:44:31.643
Why don't you teach us?

00:44:31.853 --> 00:44:32.723
Me?

00:44:33.233 --> 00:44:35.313
I can't dance properly.

00:44:37.083 --> 00:44:37.983
Me?

00:44:38.143 --> 00:44:39.923
I learnt it when I was a kid.

00:44:40.013 --> 00:44:41.893
I came to dance behind you.

00:44:47.003 --> 00:44:47.943
Oh, no.

00:44:48.043 --> 00:44:50.103
No, I am not feeling well.

00:44:58.373 --> 00:44:59.273
Hey, Aruna.

00:44:59.853 --> 00:45:00.843
What are you doing here?

00:45:01.143 --> 00:45:02.193
Do you know Bharatanatyam?

00:45:02.283 --> 00:45:04.023
I learnt it when I
was a kid, ma'am.

00:45:05.653 --> 00:45:09.023
But you don't look like you
are practising. What happened?

00:45:09.973 --> 00:45:12.193
We came here to practice.

00:45:12.663 --> 00:45:15.803
But we don't know
how to teach or learn.

00:45:16.463 --> 00:45:17.603
That's why we are sitting here.

00:45:18.643 --> 00:45:19.473
Is that all?

00:45:20.023 --> 00:45:21.523
Go and stand.
I will teach you.

00:45:21.843 --> 00:45:22.863
Ma'am, you..
- Ma'am..

00:45:23.523 --> 00:45:25.353
Do you think I don't
know how to dance?

00:45:26.163 --> 00:45:27.023
No, ma'am.

00:45:27.353 --> 00:45:29.063
I am doing this for Guna's mother.

00:45:29.313 --> 00:45:30.393
Go and stand.

00:45:30.693 --> 00:45:31.643
Okay, ma'am.

00:45:46.573 --> 00:45:47.393
Reena.

00:45:49.823 --> 00:45:51.983
What is it?
- Is Dr. Radhi a classical dancer?

00:45:52.193 --> 00:45:53.233
How would I know?

00:45:53.473 --> 00:45:54.353
Isn't she your mother?

00:45:55.353 --> 00:45:57.693
You have been irritating me
since I came here. Keep quiet.

00:45:57.843 --> 00:45:59.433
If I get angry, I'll throw you out.

00:45:59.623 --> 00:46:00.603
Dance properly.

00:46:45.013 --> 00:46:45.893
Hi.

00:46:46.203 --> 00:46:47.303
Hi, Arjun.

00:46:47.523 --> 00:46:49.023
We are meeting often.

00:46:49.393 --> 00:46:50.233
Yes.

00:46:50.563 --> 00:46:51.433
Are you following me?

00:46:51.893 --> 00:46:54.853
Hello. Didn't you come
to meet me yesterday?

00:46:55.613 --> 00:46:57.843
I am on my way to work.
- Hey, cool.

00:46:58.163 --> 00:46:59.563
I was just kidding.

00:47:00.883 --> 00:47:02.393
Why are you standing here?

00:47:03.033 --> 00:47:05.123
The cab broke down.
I have to go urgently.

00:47:05.443 --> 00:47:07.523
So I'm trying to hitch a ride.

00:47:08.023 --> 00:47:10.023
Oh.
Where are you going?

00:47:11.193 --> 00:47:13.393
I am going to the I.F. Hospital
for an interview.

00:47:14.343 --> 00:47:16.183
Can you drop me?

00:47:16.533 --> 00:47:18.523
Okay, I will drop you.
Come.

00:47:18.823 --> 00:47:19.753
Thank you.

00:48:09.143 --> 00:48:11.383
Check if there is any
vehicle and stop it.

00:48:11.563 --> 00:48:12.853
There is a vehicle coming.

00:48:13.453 --> 00:48:16.353
Stop. Stop the vehicle..
- Stop.

00:48:18.363 --> 00:48:19.233
Come here.

00:48:22.483 --> 00:48:24.413
Where is the helmet?
- She was on her way to an interview.

00:48:24.603 --> 00:48:25.683
I gave her a ride on the way.

00:48:26.343 --> 00:48:28.643
The traffic inspector will come.
Talk to him.

00:48:28.843 --> 00:48:30.513
Sir, please.

00:48:30.853 --> 00:48:33.953
Tell me the fine amount.
We will pay it. We have to go.

00:48:33.983 --> 00:48:36.353
The inspector will
tell you the fine amount.

00:48:36.483 --> 00:48:38.113
We have nothing to do with it.
Wait here.

00:48:39.593 --> 00:48:40.443
Oh, no..

00:48:40.913 --> 00:48:42.613
Check that vehicle.
- Come on.

00:48:42.933 --> 00:48:43.813
Get the documents.

00:48:44.103 --> 00:48:44.983
Check if it is okay.

00:48:49.263 --> 00:48:52.183
He is going without a helmet.
Get him. Bring him.

00:48:55.063 --> 00:48:55.983
Where is the helmet?

00:48:56.523 --> 00:48:57.483
What is it?

00:48:59.043 --> 00:48:59.923
No, Arjun.

00:49:00.113 --> 00:49:02.563
I have been waiting for this
interview for a month.

00:49:03.043 --> 00:49:04.853
I don't know
if I can attend it now.

00:49:05.973 --> 00:49:06.893
Oh, God..

00:49:09.193 --> 00:49:10.043
Sorry.

00:49:10.413 --> 00:49:11.853
It's all because of me.
- No.

00:49:12.293 --> 00:49:13.183
What did you do?

00:49:13.643 --> 00:49:15.273
You tried to help me.

00:49:33.153 --> 00:49:35.023
Sir, the inspector is here.

00:49:35.253 --> 00:49:36.433
Get your license.

00:49:40.423 --> 00:49:41.733
Give it to him.
- Sir.

00:49:46.023 --> 00:49:47.673
Thanks, Arjun.
It's getting late.

00:49:47.783 --> 00:49:49.023
Hope the interview is not over.

00:49:51.963 --> 00:49:52.933
Manasa.

00:49:55.063 --> 00:49:56.893
Call me after the interview.

00:49:57.813 --> 00:49:58.703
Okay, Arjun.

00:50:10.953 --> 00:50:12.563
Did you give the medication
to that patient?

00:50:13.683 --> 00:50:14.523
Yes.

00:50:15.353 --> 00:50:16.693
What about the lab reports?

00:50:17.783 --> 00:50:20.063
Here are the test results
and the updated reports.

00:50:24.393 --> 00:50:25.273
What is it?

00:50:25.833 --> 00:50:27.373
What? Nothing.

00:50:29.983 --> 00:50:30.853
This is a hospital.

00:50:31.093 --> 00:50:32.393
Keep your personal matters aside.

00:50:33.113 --> 00:50:34.733
Don't show me your long face.

00:50:35.023 --> 00:50:37.693
We are talking about the patients.
That's not my personal matter.

00:50:38.973 --> 00:50:40.983
Don't glare at me.
What did I do wrong?

00:50:42.193 --> 00:50:43.483
Did I do anything wrong?

00:50:43.833 --> 00:50:45.113
Or did I stalk you?

00:50:45.703 --> 00:50:46.563
Nothing.

00:50:46.753 --> 00:50:49.313
I just wanted to have
a cup of coffee with you.

00:50:49.493 --> 00:50:50.943
Is this wrong..

00:50:52.123 --> 00:50:52.963
It's not wrong.

00:50:54.013 --> 00:50:55.103
I'm going to kick you.

00:50:56.513 --> 00:50:57.983
Don't threaten me.

00:50:58.813 --> 00:51:00.233
You are not even in a relationship.

00:51:00.603 --> 00:51:01.523
Then what?

00:51:04.003 --> 00:51:04.943
See.

00:51:05.283 --> 00:51:06.523
I don't have feelings for you.

00:51:06.673 --> 00:51:07.853
This is just a cup of coffee.

00:51:08.123 --> 00:51:10.333
Why don't you come if you
have no feelings for me?

00:51:10.523 --> 00:51:13.443
Maybe she doesn't like coffee.

00:51:14.043 --> 00:51:14.943
Kamal.

00:51:15.303 --> 00:51:16.273
I'm leaving.

00:51:18.603 --> 00:51:19.563
No problem.

00:51:19.743 --> 00:51:20.853
Have a cup of tea.

00:51:21.023 --> 00:51:23.483
Or you can have
Horlicks, Boost or Ragi Malt.

00:51:26.063 --> 00:51:27.313
Why are you doing this?

00:51:27.953 --> 00:51:30.443
I don't know how
to talk to you in private.

00:51:31.553 --> 00:51:32.983
Why do you want to talk to me?

00:51:33.123 --> 00:51:35.253
I just want to talk to you.

00:51:36.133 --> 00:51:38.733
There is so much
disturbance while we talk.

00:51:42.513 --> 00:51:44.103
What do you want to say now?

00:51:57.433 --> 00:52:00.313
Everyone is waiting for you.

00:52:00.893 --> 00:52:01.983
For your answer.

00:52:10.083 --> 00:52:10.983
Let's go.

00:52:12.593 --> 00:52:13.563
I don't want Nilofer.

00:52:14.103 --> 00:52:15.853
No.
It's just the two of us.

00:52:19.463 --> 00:52:20.353
Get lost.

00:52:24.703 --> 00:52:26.313
Hi.
- Hi.

00:52:26.423 --> 00:52:27.443
Can I use the computer?

00:52:31.223 --> 00:52:34.523
You seem to be very busy.

00:52:35.083 --> 00:52:37.733
Look who's saying that.

00:52:38.773 --> 00:52:41.563
I forgot to take the soft copy
as Dr. Preetham asked.

00:52:41.953 --> 00:52:43.143
He asked for it now.

00:52:43.313 --> 00:52:46.483
He will scold me if I don't
give it. That's why I'm taking it.

00:52:47.663 --> 00:52:50.023
You seem to be very busy.

00:52:50.953 --> 00:52:54.313
You went on a strike

00:52:54.373 --> 00:52:56.023
and brought about a revolution.

00:52:56.523 --> 00:52:57.693
I didn't do anything.

00:52:58.393 --> 00:53:00.183
You didn't do anything
but go on a strike.

00:53:00.353 --> 00:53:02.733
You say you don't know
anything but you dance.

00:53:02.813 --> 00:53:04.763
Don't I know that?
- How did you know that?

00:53:05.653 --> 00:53:07.063
I know that because
they told me.

00:53:07.233 --> 00:53:10.103
Where did you learn it?
Did you take classes?

00:53:10.603 --> 00:53:14.313
No. I learnt it
from classical TV shows.

00:53:14.643 --> 00:53:17.393
It seems like there is a lot
to know about you.

00:53:17.873 --> 00:53:20.273
You know everything about me.

00:53:20.873 --> 00:53:25.053
But you don't say
anything about yourself.

00:53:25.313 --> 00:53:28.213
I don't have anything to say.

00:53:28.253 --> 00:53:29.233
That's why I didn't tell you.

00:53:29.483 --> 00:53:33.003
Don't give me such excuses.
You never open up.

00:53:37.893 --> 00:53:39.023
Amaya, are you okay?

00:53:40.283 --> 00:53:42.513
Sit down..

00:53:44.203 --> 00:53:45.843
W-What happened?

00:53:46.583 --> 00:53:47.523
All of a sudden..

00:53:48.253 --> 00:53:50.143
Show me your hand.
- It's nothing.

00:53:51.383 --> 00:53:52.423
You are bleeding.

00:53:52.503 --> 00:53:54.773
Amaya, you're bleeding.
- It's nothing.

00:53:54.963 --> 00:53:56.853
Look at me, come on.

00:54:05.853 --> 00:54:07.733
Let's take a blood test.

00:54:07.943 --> 00:54:09.693
It's nothing, Kamal.

00:54:09.993 --> 00:54:12.483
I have been coughing
for a long time.

00:54:12.823 --> 00:54:13.773
It's because of the cold.

00:54:14.193 --> 00:54:15.853
Didn't you consult any doctor?

00:54:17.313 --> 00:54:22.143
Come, let's go to Dr. Preetham.
- No.

00:54:23.643 --> 00:54:26.523
Don't tell anyone
about this, please.

00:54:27.333 --> 00:54:28.273
Why?

00:54:28.453 --> 00:54:30.393
They will ask me to get admitted.

00:54:30.493 --> 00:54:31.733
I can't go to work.

00:54:32.653 --> 00:54:34.693
It's good. Take medicines
at home. Take rest.

00:54:35.503 --> 00:54:37.733
It'd be difficult
to go through the month.

00:54:40.383 --> 00:54:41.683
What's wrong with you?

00:54:42.993 --> 00:54:44.193
Look at me.

00:54:46.143 --> 00:54:47.023
Let's do one thing.

00:54:47.183 --> 00:54:48.443
I won't tell anyone about this.

00:54:48.923 --> 00:54:50.563
But let's take a blood test.

00:54:51.333 --> 00:54:52.943
It's wrong to leave it like this.

00:54:53.893 --> 00:54:55.443
Let's see what happens.

00:54:56.393 --> 00:54:57.483
Listen to me.

00:54:57.793 --> 00:54:58.943
I will treat you.

00:54:59.353 --> 00:55:01.523
You don't have to go anywhere.
Please.

00:55:01.643 --> 00:55:03.523
You can take a rest here.

00:55:05.603 --> 00:55:07.203
Don't deny this.
That's it.

00:55:08.313 --> 00:55:09.273
Okay?

00:55:10.973 --> 00:55:11.853
Okay.

00:55:13.433 --> 00:55:15.103
Naveen, show me the report.
- Sir.

00:55:21.893 --> 00:55:23.663
There are definitely variations.

00:55:24.603 --> 00:55:26.393
But they are small.
- Yes, sir.

00:55:27.083 --> 00:55:27.943
Not an issue.

00:55:28.433 --> 00:55:29.893
We can manage it with medication.

00:55:31.103 --> 00:55:33.523
Continue with the old medicines.
- Okay, sir. - Okay, start.

00:55:46.003 --> 00:55:47.143
Observe carefully.

00:55:47.363 --> 00:55:49.533
If there is any improvement
in his vitals, update me.

00:55:49.643 --> 00:55:50.983
Okay?
- Okay, Doctor.

00:55:57.043 --> 00:55:57.943
Shit.

00:55:58.513 --> 00:55:59.893
Sir..

00:56:00.393 --> 00:56:03.103
Move..
Get the machine..

00:56:06.483 --> 00:56:07.483
What the hell?

00:56:12.753 --> 00:56:13.773
What the hell?

00:56:14.743 --> 00:56:15.793
How is this possible?

00:56:15.983 --> 00:56:16.813
What happened?

00:56:17.793 --> 00:56:19.853
The clot should
have reduced by now.

00:56:24.543 --> 00:56:25.433
It's over.

00:56:26.233 --> 00:56:27.273
Sir.

00:56:29.193 --> 00:56:32.693
Shall I inform the attendants?

00:56:34.123 --> 00:56:36.193
No, Naveen.
I will tell them.

00:56:43.973 --> 00:56:45.023
Hey.

00:56:45.433 --> 00:56:47.063
All the medications
were working fine.

00:56:47.903 --> 00:56:50.393
He was alive until
five minutes ago.

00:56:52.443 --> 00:56:55.233
The medicine should have
reduced the clot and cured him.

00:56:56.563 --> 00:56:57.483
I don't understand.

00:57:02.933 --> 00:57:04.353
Have you taken the blood samples?

00:57:04.563 --> 00:57:05.443
Yes.

00:57:14.273 --> 00:57:15.273
One minute.

00:57:17.733 --> 00:57:19.313
Doctor.
What happened, Doctor?

00:57:19.483 --> 00:57:21.023
Is he okay?

00:57:22.583 --> 00:57:24.813
As per protocol

00:57:25.453 --> 00:57:26.643
we tried everything.

00:57:27.183 --> 00:57:28.193
But..

00:57:29.793 --> 00:57:31.733
Very sorry to say.

00:57:34.613 --> 00:57:35.853
He is dead.

00:57:39.003 --> 00:57:39.853
What?

00:57:40.933 --> 00:57:42.143
What are you saying, Doctor?

00:57:43.493 --> 00:57:45.643
You said you can save him
when we brought him in.

00:57:45.993 --> 00:57:47.693
Now you are saying he is dead.

00:57:47.963 --> 00:57:49.393
Madam, try to understand.

00:57:49.913 --> 00:57:53.773
I said that we can save him
if it was within three hours.

00:57:54.193 --> 00:57:57.853
I won't spare you.
I won't spare any of you.

00:57:59.433 --> 00:58:00.893
I will complain about you.

00:58:02.923 --> 00:58:03.813
Sir.

00:58:04.443 --> 00:58:05.443
What happened, sir?

00:58:06.333 --> 00:58:09.523
They said it was a stroke.
They said it had only been an hour.

00:58:09.943 --> 00:58:12.233
I gave him IV
thrombolysis as usual.

00:58:13.393 --> 00:58:14.693
The clot should have reduced.

00:58:15.603 --> 00:58:19.193
But before the medicines could
react, his body went into arrest.

00:58:19.443 --> 00:58:20.563
Very strange, Arjun.

00:58:23.153 --> 00:58:24.483
How long will it take
for the lab results?

00:58:24.583 --> 00:58:25.983
I've told them, ma'am,
it will come soon.

00:58:35.343 --> 00:58:37.103
You should have been careful, sir.

00:58:38.373 --> 00:58:39.603
What are you saying, Arjun?

00:58:40.693 --> 00:58:42.843
When a patient comes
to the hospital on emergency

00:58:43.523 --> 00:58:45.353
the first thing to do
is to administer first aid.

00:58:45.733 --> 00:58:47.273
That's what we have done.

00:58:47.503 --> 00:58:48.523
In such a situation

00:58:48.613 --> 00:58:51.143
we can't stop and think
about it in leisure.

00:58:51.313 --> 00:58:52.813
Who is responsible
for the patient's life then?

00:58:53.123 --> 00:58:54.693
Who is responsible for this, sir?

00:58:55.773 --> 00:58:56.693
Arjun..

00:58:57.163 --> 00:59:00.683
We started the treatment with the
information given by Veera's wife.

00:59:00.733 --> 00:59:01.563
Exactly.

00:59:02.403 --> 00:59:05.833
Usually, we can reverse the stroke
within three hours. - That's right.

00:59:06.703 --> 00:59:08.103
Actually, this shouldn't
have happened.

00:59:08.353 --> 00:59:09.983
Then how the hell did this happen?

00:59:11.393 --> 00:59:12.603
Sir..

00:59:13.313 --> 00:59:15.023
Look at the reports here.

00:59:15.313 --> 00:59:16.853
Veera's toxicology reports.

00:59:18.623 --> 00:59:19.443
What?

00:59:21.003 --> 00:59:22.063
Who ordered the blood test?

00:59:23.053 --> 00:59:23.953
Sir.

00:59:25.313 --> 00:59:26.193
I ordered it.

00:59:29.883 --> 00:59:32.643
Ma'am, you shouldn't sit here.
- I can't, sir.

00:59:32.683 --> 00:59:35.043
Ma'am, the doctor asked you
to wait in the room, right?

00:59:35.173 --> 00:59:37.633
Are you afraid that your crimes
will be leaked?

00:59:37.863 --> 00:59:38.943
Nothing like that, ma'am.

00:59:39.233 --> 00:59:40.523
Please, let's talk.

00:59:42.353 --> 00:59:43.233
Sir.

00:59:44.793 --> 00:59:46.193
You killed my husband.

00:59:46.403 --> 00:59:47.773
What are you trying to say now?

00:59:47.803 --> 00:59:50.063
Wait, wait.
This is a hospital.

00:59:51.753 --> 00:59:52.943
When you admitted your husband

00:59:53.623 --> 00:59:55.643
didn't you know
that you had to tell the truth?

00:59:55.803 --> 00:59:57.273
I told you everything, sir.

00:59:57.463 --> 00:59:58.483
What more do I have to say?

00:59:58.573 --> 00:59:59.943
You didn't tell us one fact.

01:00:00.323 --> 01:00:02.233
Your husband was taking
a BP tablet.

01:00:04.553 --> 01:00:07.393
Don't lie to cover up
your mistakes.

01:00:09.213 --> 01:00:10.063
One.

01:00:11.173 --> 01:00:12.773
He must have attempted
to commit suicide.

01:00:13.353 --> 01:00:15.733
Or, without his knowledge

01:00:15.833 --> 01:00:18.643
someone must have mixed
these pills in his food.

01:00:22.503 --> 01:00:23.443
What?

01:00:24.043 --> 01:00:25.523
Are you trying to blame me?

01:00:26.193 --> 01:00:28.013
I have to file a police complaint.

01:00:28.063 --> 01:00:29.773
No one is blaming anyone here.

01:00:29.933 --> 01:00:31.063
Naveen.
- Sir.

01:00:31.613 --> 01:00:33.063
We are talking with evidence.

01:00:33.903 --> 01:00:35.093
Your husband's reports.

01:00:35.213 --> 01:00:36.273
We just got it from the lab.

01:00:37.233 --> 01:00:38.063
Look here.

01:00:38.543 --> 01:00:42.583
I don't know whether you knew that
your husband had taken those pills.

01:00:43.083 --> 01:00:46.353
But I am going to shift this case
for a police investigation.

01:00:46.773 --> 01:00:47.953
Let them come and find out

01:00:48.403 --> 01:00:49.443
who is at fault.

01:00:49.963 --> 01:00:51.103
Arun.
- Sir.

01:00:51.493 --> 01:00:52.893
Inform the police.
- Yes, sir.

01:00:58.823 --> 01:00:59.853
What is with Radhi?

01:01:00.583 --> 01:01:03.873
Is she pretending
to sacrifice something

01:01:04.223 --> 01:01:06.273
by giving up
my position as the chief doctor?

01:01:06.923 --> 01:01:09.063
Arjun is shouting
without investigating anything.

01:01:10.843 --> 01:01:11.683
Sir.

01:01:11.773 --> 01:01:14.483
What can he do if the patients'
visitors complain to him?

01:01:14.873 --> 01:01:16.353
It's okay if he does it once.

01:01:16.773 --> 01:01:18.893
How will you feel
if he does it again and again?

01:01:19.883 --> 01:01:21.023
Even I feel the same.

01:01:22.483 --> 01:01:23.683
What do you want me to do now?

01:01:24.643 --> 01:01:25.523
Sir.

01:01:25.583 --> 01:01:27.023
In such a humiliating place..

01:01:27.143 --> 01:01:28.313
Are you asking me to resign?

01:01:29.673 --> 01:01:31.413
Are you asking me
to quit the job? - No, sir.

01:01:31.723 --> 01:01:33.283
When I joined here as a newbie

01:01:33.463 --> 01:01:35.563
Arjun was also a newbie as a CEO.

01:01:35.683 --> 01:01:36.853
Radhi was also not here.

01:01:37.143 --> 01:01:39.143
He didn't know what to do.

01:01:39.593 --> 01:01:43.853
I played a major role in running
this hospital during that time.

01:01:44.793 --> 01:01:47.223
They have forgotten the gratitude.
They are questioning me.

01:01:47.783 --> 01:01:50.773
Listen, even if I resign

01:01:51.483 --> 01:01:53.603
I will do something
in such a way

01:01:53.623 --> 01:01:56.023
that the entire hospital
remembers me for a long time.

01:01:57.713 --> 01:01:59.303
Whether it is a good thing

01:02:01.063 --> 01:02:02.483
or a bad thing.

01:03:10.819 --> 01:03:14.069
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:03:15.899 --> 01:03:18.449
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:03:20.989 --> 01:03:23.809
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:03:25.619 --> 01:03:27.979
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:03:28.129 --> 01:03:30.659
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:03:30.709 --> 01:03:33.489
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:03:33.529 --> 01:03:35.979
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:03:38.439 --> 01:03:41.279
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:03:43.529 --> 01:03:46.029
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:03:48.199 --> 01:03:52.769
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:04:04.309 --> 01:04:06.369
Everything is as I guessed.

01:04:06.509 --> 01:04:07.719
Ma'am.
- Did you check?

01:04:07.829 --> 01:04:08.699
Yes, ma'am.

01:04:10.589 --> 01:04:11.489
Did you ask for me?

01:04:13.829 --> 01:04:14.669
Yes, Reena.

01:04:15.359 --> 01:04:17.029
I wanted to meet you
regarding Ganga.

01:04:17.649 --> 01:04:19.699
We are not going to do
a bypass surgery on Ganga.

01:04:19.989 --> 01:04:22.739
We will do an Angio
and deploy a stent.

01:04:23.339 --> 01:04:25.699
Ma'am, we had already
given her a stent.

01:04:26.109 --> 01:04:28.819
Also, she has a thrombus
growth in the last stent.

01:04:30.409 --> 01:04:32.279
That patient is 50 years old.

01:04:32.979 --> 01:04:35.109
There is a risk factor
in doing an open heart surgery.

01:04:35.829 --> 01:04:37.159
That's okay, ma'am.

01:04:37.579 --> 01:04:39.449
But if the open heart
surgery is successful

01:04:39.579 --> 01:04:41.199
she will have a long painless life.

01:04:41.529 --> 01:04:43.239
But a stent doesn't guarantee it.

01:04:44.069 --> 01:04:46.409
Oh, have you become
a great doctor now?

01:04:46.769 --> 01:04:48.139
Why are you advising me?

01:04:49.989 --> 01:04:51.609
We are talking
about the patient here.

01:04:52.309 --> 01:04:54.779
I am not fighting you
or defending myself.

01:04:55.239 --> 01:04:56.359
Then do what I say.

01:04:57.999 --> 01:05:02.119
You usually tell everyone to do
whatever is good for the patient.

01:05:02.309 --> 01:05:03.779
I am trying to do the same.

01:05:04.969 --> 01:05:07.409
You are acting like Dr. Preetham
because of your ego.

01:05:08.859 --> 01:05:11.729
When a senior doctor
gives you an alternative option

01:05:11.779 --> 01:05:14.409
since the procedure
you are going to do is incorrect

01:05:14.649 --> 01:05:17.909
you are not accepting that
and not even analysing it.

01:05:18.189 --> 01:05:20.239
Instead, you are adamant
on doing it your way.

01:05:21.069 --> 01:05:22.209
Think about it.

01:05:22.439 --> 01:05:23.989
Who is being egoistical here?

01:05:29.529 --> 01:05:32.279
Reena, the surgery is going
to take place in a few hours.

01:05:33.519 --> 01:05:34.899
We're going
by the procedure of my choice.

01:06:02.419 --> 01:06:03.319
Reena.

01:06:03.899 --> 01:06:04.949
Concentrate.

01:06:05.669 --> 01:06:08.119
This is why I told you.
Her BP is dropping now.

01:06:08.519 --> 01:06:10.359
It is not a good option
to do an angio on Ganga.

01:06:10.749 --> 01:06:11.699
Reena shut up.

01:06:12.169 --> 01:06:13.029
Do what I say.

01:06:13.529 --> 01:06:15.659
This is just a normal
blood vessel dilation.

01:06:15.939 --> 01:06:17.069
Inject some saline.

01:06:40.469 --> 01:06:43.069
Her BP is back to normal.
What do you have to say now?

01:06:54.119 --> 01:06:55.149
What happened, Doctor?

01:06:55.689 --> 01:06:58.609
Sir, the surgery went well.
- Thank God.

01:06:58.679 --> 01:07:00.619
We have to observe her
for a few days.

01:07:00.679 --> 01:07:02.739
So far, she is not in any danger.
Don't worry.

01:07:03.249 --> 01:07:07.949
Thank you so much, Reena.
My wife's trust in you was not in vain.

01:07:08.369 --> 01:07:09.399
Thank you, Dr. Radhi.

01:07:09.989 --> 01:07:14.409
You have saved my wife for the
second time by doing this surgery.

01:07:14.579 --> 01:07:15.399
Thank you so much.

01:07:15.649 --> 01:07:16.859
Sir, this is our duty.

01:07:17.989 --> 01:07:18.779
Thank you, Reena.

01:07:19.149 --> 01:07:20.109
When can I see Ganga?

01:07:21.159 --> 01:07:23.389
Sir, she will be transferred
to the recovery room in a while.

01:07:23.479 --> 01:07:24.629
You can see her.
- Thank you.

01:07:24.719 --> 01:07:25.949
You can go there and see her.
- Thank you, ma'am.

01:07:31.299 --> 01:07:32.239
Did you see?

01:07:32.819 --> 01:07:33.779
The patient is safe.

01:07:34.699 --> 01:07:37.739
Reena, it is okay to analyse
and diagnose a patient.

01:07:38.319 --> 01:07:42.109
But if a senior doctor gives
alternative options, learn to obey.

01:07:43.359 --> 01:07:45.859
This is not a court to argue
or to prove anything, Reena.

01:07:46.609 --> 01:07:49.989
I also gained experience
step by step like you, to be here.

01:07:50.529 --> 01:07:52.859
It requires continuous
learning and practice.

01:07:54.569 --> 01:07:56.769
Obedience is more
important than all that.

01:07:56.989 --> 01:07:58.029
You need patience.

01:07:59.779 --> 01:08:02.449
If you want to become
a good doctor in your life

01:08:03.599 --> 01:08:04.819
learn to follow this.

01:08:19.069 --> 01:08:21.389
Where are you off to?

01:08:21.489 --> 01:08:22.329
Out.

01:08:22.649 --> 01:08:23.519
Out?

01:08:23.679 --> 01:08:26.929
I think Reena has
agreed to the date.

01:08:27.489 --> 01:08:28.359
Yes.

01:08:29.449 --> 01:08:30.749
What do you mean by yes?

01:08:30.989 --> 01:08:32.489
I was just kidding.

01:08:32.949 --> 01:08:35.019
Did she really agree to the date?

01:08:35.269 --> 01:08:37.819
Yes.
- How did you do it?

01:08:38.599 --> 01:08:39.779
That's my personality.

01:08:39.889 --> 01:08:40.739
Personality?

01:08:40.899 --> 01:08:42.499
Okay.
- Where are you going?

01:08:43.229 --> 01:08:45.419
He is going on a date with Reena.
- Hi.

01:08:45.979 --> 01:08:47.989
Kamal, can't you keep quiet?

01:08:49.069 --> 01:08:49.989
Don't you have work?

01:08:50.859 --> 01:08:51.819
My shift is over.

01:08:53.819 --> 01:08:55.049
Why are you going out with her?

01:08:55.569 --> 01:08:56.609
Why shouldn't I go?

01:09:00.939 --> 01:09:03.759
What did Reena say?
Did she agree to it?

01:09:04.509 --> 01:09:07.489
Do I look like
I am forcefully taking her?

01:09:09.349 --> 01:09:10.739
Reena won't agree so easily.

01:09:11.209 --> 01:09:13.149
What do you mean?
I don't understand.

01:09:13.789 --> 01:09:16.199
Why? Do you think
she shouldn't go on a date with me?

01:09:16.779 --> 01:09:18.989
She is not in a relationship
nor is she dating anyone.

01:09:19.629 --> 01:09:21.819
Is that what she said?

01:09:22.709 --> 01:09:23.609
Sir.

01:09:23.979 --> 01:09:26.199
She doesn't have any problem
going on a date with me.

01:09:26.489 --> 01:09:27.359
What's your problem?

01:09:27.649 --> 01:09:29.779
What is this?
Your tone is changing.

01:09:30.699 --> 01:09:31.699
Mind your words.

01:09:31.989 --> 01:09:35.409
You can ask me if I did
anything wrong in the hospital.

01:09:35.699 --> 01:09:37.989
That is different.
This is my personal life.

01:09:38.399 --> 01:09:41.109
If you get involved in this,
I won't keep quiet.

01:09:49.939 --> 01:09:53.239
Hey, Kiran.
I can feel some tension here.

01:09:53.579 --> 01:09:55.159
I'm not the reason for it, right?

01:10:01.719 --> 01:10:02.599
Reena.

01:10:02.989 --> 01:10:04.279
Arjun, don't ask me anything.

01:10:05.289 --> 01:10:07.569
I just got back from a surgery.
Not a good time.

01:10:08.259 --> 01:10:10.819
Mr. Rajendar said
that the surgery went well.

01:10:11.079 --> 01:10:13.239
It did go well.
But what do I do?

01:10:13.739 --> 01:10:16.699
Whether the surgery went well
or not, I still have problems.

01:10:17.869 --> 01:10:20.529
I don't know how I missed this.
A small error.

01:10:21.919 --> 01:10:23.899
My anger hid my eyes.

01:10:23.949 --> 01:10:25.279
Are you going on a date with Kiran?

01:10:30.349 --> 01:10:32.909
Yes. I am going.
Why do you ask?

01:10:37.159 --> 01:10:39.529
You said you would move on.

01:10:40.899 --> 01:10:43.949
But I didn't expect you
to move on so soon.

01:10:45.109 --> 01:10:46.779
I told you everything is over.

01:10:46.939 --> 01:10:49.359
Then why do you care
if I move on quickly or not?

01:10:52.989 --> 01:10:55.239
Arjun, I don't have
to explain anything to you.

01:10:55.389 --> 01:10:56.569
But I will tell you this.

01:10:56.989 --> 01:10:58.739
I am going to have
a cup of coffee with him.

01:10:58.859 --> 01:11:01.819
I am going out as a friend.
That's all. Is that wrong?

01:11:02.559 --> 01:11:05.029
Or do you have a problem with this?

01:11:07.939 --> 01:11:08.859
No.

01:11:12.399 --> 01:11:13.779
Reena, shall we go?

01:11:15.379 --> 01:11:17.329
Aren't you ready yet?

01:11:19.359 --> 01:11:20.529
I'm about to get ready.

01:11:22.239 --> 01:11:24.319
Can you wear a blue-coloured dress?

01:11:25.159 --> 01:11:27.649
Not this shade of blue,
but this one.

01:11:28.179 --> 01:11:30.529
Are these scrubs okay?

01:11:31.319 --> 01:11:33.279
I thought a normal blue
dress would be better.

01:11:33.449 --> 01:11:36.449
Why?
- We are going on our first date.

01:11:36.919 --> 01:11:38.989
I thought it'd be nice if we
colour-coordinated our outfits.

01:12:00.399 --> 01:12:03.449
Teju, you used to chase me
away whenever I came to you.

01:12:03.879 --> 01:12:07.199
Now you are sitting here.
It's new.

01:12:07.409 --> 01:12:09.059
There is a reason for everything.

01:12:10.429 --> 01:12:12.329
How is your brother?

01:12:13.949 --> 01:12:14.859
Brother?

01:12:15.789 --> 01:12:17.229
Why are you asking me about him?

01:12:17.659 --> 01:12:18.609
Just tell me.

01:12:20.289 --> 01:12:21.109
He is fine.

01:12:21.739 --> 01:12:23.789
Arjun said he will clear the loan.

01:12:24.159 --> 01:12:25.699
So, it's okay.

01:12:28.029 --> 01:12:29.949
Did that hero save him?

01:12:32.089 --> 01:12:34.399
He asked for a chance to reform.

01:12:35.239 --> 01:12:36.909
But Arjun said he
can't give him a job.

01:12:37.209 --> 01:12:39.399
So, he is looking for a job.

01:12:39.889 --> 01:12:40.739
He didn't get any.

01:12:41.129 --> 01:12:42.659
If you know of any job vacancies,
tell me.

01:12:45.659 --> 01:12:48.029
Your family
is an interesting family.

01:12:51.109 --> 01:12:53.399
Why are you so concerned
about our family?

01:12:54.379 --> 01:12:55.739
There is a reason for everything.

01:12:56.199 --> 01:12:59.819
Shouldn't I keep track
of your siblings? - Hey!

01:13:01.549 --> 01:13:03.529
Why are you mentioning siblings?

01:13:03.659 --> 01:13:05.529
I don't want anyone
to know about that.

01:13:06.029 --> 01:13:08.009
Yes, I wanted to talk about it.

01:13:08.199 --> 01:13:10.569
There is nothing to talk about,
just don't mention it here.

01:13:11.939 --> 01:13:13.679
I don't want anyone
to know about it.

01:13:14.219 --> 01:13:16.899
Don't think that
no one knows about it.

01:13:18.299 --> 01:13:19.359
I don't think that.

01:13:19.409 --> 01:13:20.659
You know everything.

01:13:21.799 --> 01:13:24.699
Then, don't think that no one
knows about it except me.

01:13:25.999 --> 01:13:26.859
Hey!

01:13:27.879 --> 01:13:28.949
What are you saying, Teju?

01:13:29.619 --> 01:13:30.569
Whom did you tell?

01:13:31.109 --> 01:13:32.239
I am talking to you.

01:13:33.509 --> 01:13:34.419
I told Guna.

01:13:35.479 --> 01:13:38.159
Gu.. Are you mad?
Why did you tell him?

01:13:38.859 --> 01:13:41.199
Then? He is always glaring at me.

01:13:41.449 --> 01:13:43.149
Why I should be blamed
for what you did?

01:13:43.879 --> 01:13:45.529
What will you do
if he tells someone?

01:13:45.799 --> 01:13:46.739
So what?

01:13:47.189 --> 01:13:48.399
You will be ruined.

01:13:48.699 --> 01:13:50.569
Such cruelty..
- Why are you telling me that?

01:13:50.799 --> 01:13:52.739
He is going to tell everyone.

01:13:52.789 --> 01:13:53.819
Oh, no..

01:13:55.279 --> 01:13:56.129
Hey!
- Why would..

01:13:56.669 --> 01:13:58.699
Don't cry
like you did the other day.

01:13:59.459 --> 01:14:01.449
He won't tell anyone.
Leave it.

01:14:03.079 --> 01:14:04.699
How do you know that
he won't tell anyone?

01:14:04.909 --> 01:14:06.569
Because I know something about him.

01:14:08.299 --> 01:14:09.399
Something about him?

01:14:10.799 --> 01:14:13.149
Did he do something and
cheat anyone in the hospital?

01:14:14.109 --> 01:14:15.569
He is cheating the entire hospital.

01:14:20.319 --> 01:14:22.779
How do you know all these things?

01:14:26.489 --> 01:14:27.899
Because I am Teju.

01:14:30.659 --> 01:14:31.529
Nothing.

01:14:31.949 --> 01:14:33.609
I came to tell you
about this. Be careful.

01:14:34.499 --> 01:14:36.299
I should be careful
till I am with you.

01:14:37.239 --> 01:14:38.069
Oh, wow.

01:14:40.689 --> 01:14:41.899
I want to talk to Teju.

01:14:41.919 --> 01:14:42.779
Can you..
- Sure, ma'am.

01:14:43.229 --> 01:14:44.359
Thanks.
- Bye, Teju.

01:14:49.819 --> 01:14:50.899
Shall I order coffee?

01:14:51.059 --> 01:14:51.949
No.

01:14:52.119 --> 01:14:52.989
Do you know something?

01:14:53.519 --> 01:14:54.359
What?

01:14:54.399 --> 01:14:55.529
The coffee here is not good.

01:14:55.869 --> 01:14:57.399
Did you come here to tell me this?

01:15:00.389 --> 01:15:02.319
Reena and I operated on Ganga.

01:15:02.469 --> 01:15:04.449
Ganga is under observation now.

01:15:04.669 --> 01:15:05.819
Reena is taking care.

01:15:06.119 --> 01:15:07.819
You too take care of her.
- Ma'am.

01:15:08.569 --> 01:15:10.739
She has been glaring
at me since I came here.

01:15:11.059 --> 01:15:12.319
How can I work with her?

01:15:13.299 --> 01:15:16.659
I don't understand. Why do you keep
giving me unnecessary problems?

01:15:16.959 --> 01:15:20.369
Even the other day, you came to my
clinic when you had a problem.

01:15:20.519 --> 01:15:23.569
Then you dragged me along
with you to this hospital.

01:15:23.759 --> 01:15:25.729
Now you're sitting here saying
that Reena has a problem.

01:15:26.559 --> 01:15:30.069
This started when
you came to my clinic.

01:15:37.949 --> 01:15:38.779
Ma'am.

01:15:39.529 --> 01:15:41.489
Can I ask you something?
- What?

01:15:41.819 --> 01:15:43.459
What is the problem
between you and Reena?

01:15:43.919 --> 01:15:45.029
I don't have any problem.

01:15:46.529 --> 01:15:47.699
She studied hard.

01:15:48.069 --> 01:15:50.109
She came to this
hospital in search of you.

01:15:51.379 --> 01:15:52.899
It's okay if you don't accept her.

01:15:53.559 --> 01:15:55.319
But why do you treat her
like an enemy?

01:15:56.149 --> 01:15:59.989
I didn't scold her because
I saw her as an enemy.

01:16:00.689 --> 01:16:03.279
I did it so that she could learn
and succeed in her career.

01:16:03.839 --> 01:16:06.359
It won't be good for her future
if she behaves like this.

01:16:06.929 --> 01:16:08.699
But you are overdoing it too.

01:16:09.409 --> 01:16:12.449
You could have given her some space
and treated her better.

01:16:13.439 --> 01:16:14.529
You asked her to leave.

01:16:14.629 --> 01:16:15.489
But she came back.

01:16:15.639 --> 01:16:18.319
After you came back,
you want to cancel her case.

01:16:18.359 --> 01:16:19.199
How can you do that?

01:16:19.829 --> 01:16:21.229
Both of you want to talk..

01:16:22.199 --> 01:16:24.069
But the talks end up in a fight.

01:16:31.569 --> 01:16:33.279
Why am I getting emotional?

01:16:35.199 --> 01:16:36.819
Ma'am, this is your family issue.

01:16:37.339 --> 01:16:40.529
Whatever you do with Reena,
I have nothing to do with it.

01:16:41.519 --> 01:16:42.419
Leave it.

01:16:43.069 --> 01:16:44.719
I will take care of Ganga.

01:16:45.729 --> 01:16:46.779
Okay, bye.

01:17:08.259 --> 01:17:09.239
Superb!

01:17:10.019 --> 01:17:10.839
Thanks.

01:17:10.949 --> 01:17:11.859
Why are you thanking me?

01:17:12.269 --> 01:17:15.409
You're wearing a blue dress
like I asked. That's why.

01:17:15.619 --> 01:17:18.569
Do you think I bring 10 dresses
every day to choose what I wear?

01:17:18.759 --> 01:17:20.199
I came to work in this dress.

01:17:20.779 --> 01:17:22.819
It's okay. I'll consider
that you wore it for me.

01:17:24.819 --> 01:17:25.989
Shall we go?

01:17:27.949 --> 01:17:28.819
I will book a cab.

01:17:29.169 --> 01:17:30.609
Cab?
What is this?

01:17:31.099 --> 01:17:32.279
We are going to travel a lot.

01:17:32.569 --> 01:17:33.809
It will cost a lot to book a cab.

01:17:36.239 --> 01:17:37.069
What about an auto?

01:17:37.859 --> 01:17:39.069
We have a vehicle.

01:17:39.689 --> 01:17:40.659
We have the capacity.

01:17:41.049 --> 01:17:43.569
We can travel the world.

01:17:45.319 --> 01:17:46.869
I like one thing about you.

01:17:48.299 --> 01:17:49.239
One second.

01:17:51.249 --> 01:17:52.119
Tell me.

01:17:53.519 --> 01:17:57.279
You like to spend less,
I like your way of thinking.

01:17:57.669 --> 01:18:01.029
Even I don't like
to spend unnecessarily.

01:18:02.149 --> 01:18:04.689
You liked my first impression.

01:18:05.019 --> 01:18:06.949
You will like me too.

01:18:08.189 --> 01:18:09.199
Shall we go?

01:18:09.999 --> 01:18:12.499
Are you going to leave me
if I don't come? - No.

01:18:19.609 --> 01:18:20.589
What are you looking at?

01:18:21.269 --> 01:18:23.949
Is this a coffee shop?
- What do you mean?

01:18:24.119 --> 01:18:25.279
You will get everything here.

01:18:25.529 --> 01:18:27.909
Sorry.
You will get everything special.

01:18:28.519 --> 01:18:29.399
Tell me what you want.

01:18:29.949 --> 01:18:31.859
Coffee, tea, samosa,
sandwich, bread omelette..

01:18:31.889 --> 01:18:32.949
Beedi, cigarette?

01:18:34.569 --> 01:18:37.029
Let's avoid the last two.

01:18:37.819 --> 01:18:39.379
There are several items
on the menu here.

01:18:40.199 --> 01:18:41.239
Let's go.

01:18:44.889 --> 01:18:45.989
Sir.
- Kiran.

01:18:46.269 --> 01:18:47.949
It's been a long time.
How are you?

01:18:48.119 --> 01:18:50.149
I am fine. How are you?
- I am fine too.

01:18:50.369 --> 01:18:52.609
Sir, she is my guest.

01:18:53.549 --> 01:18:56.009
Get us two special cups of tea.

01:18:56.149 --> 01:18:58.859
Go ahead and sit.
I will get it specially for you.

01:18:59.739 --> 01:19:00.609
Let's go, Reena.

01:19:12.819 --> 01:19:13.649
Eat well.

01:19:14.149 --> 01:19:15.069
Eat happily.

01:19:15.179 --> 01:19:16.029
Okay, sir.

01:19:17.079 --> 01:19:18.869
You only ordered two cups of tea.

01:19:19.489 --> 01:19:20.739
When did you order all this?

01:19:21.059 --> 01:19:21.899
Just two cups of tea.

01:19:22.179 --> 01:19:23.149
But it's special.

01:19:23.739 --> 01:19:25.449
Why did you order so much?

01:19:25.929 --> 01:19:29.109
Even if you eat all these again,
it won't exceed Rs. 200.

01:19:30.519 --> 01:19:32.519
You are impressing me a lot.

01:19:32.929 --> 01:19:33.899
Thank you.

01:19:53.449 --> 01:19:55.149
Hey, it's really delicious.

01:19:55.459 --> 01:19:56.699
Did I tell you so?

01:19:57.229 --> 01:20:00.149
Didn't I tell you it'll be superb?
I know.

01:20:00.189 --> 01:20:01.339
Instead of going to cafes

01:20:01.389 --> 01:20:04.259
and having cappuccinos and
hot chocolates which we don't like

01:20:04.699 --> 01:20:08.369
it's much better to eat what we
like while we have a conversation.

01:20:09.069 --> 01:20:10.029
This is my lifestyle.

01:20:10.269 --> 01:20:13.069
I don't know how to pretend
to do high-class things.

01:20:13.579 --> 01:20:15.989
It's difficult too.
They are my friends.

01:20:16.959 --> 01:20:17.869
The tea shop owner.

01:20:18.229 --> 01:20:21.199
The auto drivers in the next lane.

01:20:21.339 --> 01:20:23.819
The kids who play
carom in my area.

01:20:24.069 --> 01:20:24.919
They are my friends.

01:20:25.559 --> 01:20:28.069
Hey, Reena, you know
how stressful our hospital is.

01:20:28.379 --> 01:20:30.939
But when I come here and see them

01:20:31.099 --> 01:20:34.569
I forget that I'm a doctor,
I forget all my problems

01:20:34.899 --> 01:20:36.529
and I lead a jolly and happy life.

01:20:37.859 --> 01:20:38.699
This is me.

01:20:40.379 --> 01:20:41.209
I like it.

01:20:41.279 --> 01:20:42.909
Eat the rest,
you'll like everything.

01:20:43.879 --> 01:20:46.699
I didn't mean that.
I meant that I like your lifestyle.

01:20:54.059 --> 01:20:57.439
Reena, if you are okay,
shall we go to the beach?

01:20:58.409 --> 01:21:00.819
What are you saying?
Did you call her to the beach?

01:21:01.239 --> 01:21:02.909
What did she say?

01:21:04.409 --> 01:21:05.499
She said, "Let's go".

01:21:08.149 --> 01:21:11.989
Okay, you went to the beach.
Then what happened?

01:21:12.109 --> 01:21:14.739
First, we bought cobs
of fried corn and ate it.

01:21:15.069 --> 01:21:18.369
We ate the corn patiently
and spoke to each other.

01:21:18.569 --> 01:21:19.699
She spoke well.

01:21:20.939 --> 01:21:22.319
She told me a lot about her.

01:21:22.819 --> 01:21:24.239
The first time she came to Chennai

01:21:24.409 --> 01:21:26.159
when she joined
the hospital as an intern..

01:21:26.589 --> 01:21:27.899
She told me a lot about her.

01:21:28.399 --> 01:21:30.149
When she was an intern
at the hospital

01:21:30.339 --> 01:21:31.739
the first case that she attended..

01:21:32.149 --> 01:21:35.109
Her first surgery..
She kept telling me about her.

01:21:35.849 --> 01:21:37.659
While we were
talking about all this

01:21:38.289 --> 01:21:42.359
the sea breeze was
blowing melodiously.

01:21:43.279 --> 01:21:46.949
Her hair was swaying in the breeze.

01:21:47.589 --> 01:21:50.819
She slowly tucked it
behind her ear.

01:21:52.319 --> 01:21:54.109
While all this was happening

01:21:54.819 --> 01:21:56.449
she didn't stop talking.

01:21:56.779 --> 01:21:58.489
Suddenly, her leg touched mine.

01:21:58.649 --> 01:21:59.569
Oh, no!

01:21:59.849 --> 01:22:00.739
After that..

01:22:02.979 --> 01:22:05.939
Sorry.. Sorry.

01:22:07.039 --> 01:22:07.859
It's okay.

01:22:08.779 --> 01:22:10.649
It's not wrong.

01:22:17.779 --> 01:22:19.359
Why are you stopping? Tell me.

01:22:19.499 --> 01:22:22.159
We had a good conversation.

01:22:22.759 --> 01:22:25.819
We even cracked a few jokes.

01:22:26.289 --> 01:22:29.199
She was laughing at my jokes
and I was laughing at her.

01:22:29.789 --> 01:22:30.989
We spoke for a long time.

01:22:31.679 --> 01:22:36.689
Even those who are so cynical
against love and relationships

01:22:36.779 --> 01:22:40.229
will automatically fall in love
when they go to a beach.

01:22:40.279 --> 01:22:43.199
Of course.
- Because of the beach vibes.

01:22:44.309 --> 01:22:47.199
After all this,
the last thing she asked was..

01:22:47.319 --> 01:22:48.569
What did she ask?

01:22:50.449 --> 01:22:51.319
It's getting late, Kiran.

01:22:51.859 --> 01:22:52.699
Shall we go?

01:22:53.879 --> 01:22:55.609
Let's go.
- You left so soon?

01:22:56.039 --> 01:22:58.089
Wait.
First date should end, right?

01:22:58.289 --> 01:22:59.149
Yes.

01:22:59.249 --> 01:23:00.989
But it didn't end like this.

01:23:03.409 --> 01:23:07.569
We left from there
and walked along the beach shore.

01:23:14.239 --> 01:23:15.109
Reena.

01:23:16.789 --> 01:23:17.629
What?

01:23:20.119 --> 01:23:22.279
In English movies,
after the first date

01:23:22.569 --> 01:23:24.169
when the hero drops
the heroine at home

01:23:24.609 --> 01:23:25.459
they kiss.

01:23:25.949 --> 01:23:26.819
Did you know that?

01:23:28.889 --> 01:23:32.149
No, I asked if you
know or have seen it.

01:23:34.239 --> 01:23:37.429
I understood.
We don't have it in our culture.

01:23:38.139 --> 01:23:39.529
But it's common in other countries.

01:23:40.179 --> 01:23:41.209
What are you trying to say?

01:23:41.969 --> 01:23:42.819
Reena.

01:23:43.239 --> 01:23:44.279
I can't.

01:23:44.979 --> 01:23:45.819
Shall I ask you?

01:23:48.089 --> 01:23:50.489
Shall I hug you just once?

01:24:04.609 --> 01:24:07.569
She came close to me
and hugged me, Kamal.

01:24:09.739 --> 01:24:10.779
That second..

01:24:12.099 --> 01:24:14.779
I felt like I was going to die.

01:24:15.109 --> 01:24:16.649
What you are saying
makes me shiver.

01:24:17.109 --> 01:24:17.999
Wow..
- What did he say?

01:24:19.479 --> 01:24:20.759
What did he say?
What did you say?

01:24:20.889 --> 01:24:21.899
He didn't say anything.

01:24:22.619 --> 01:24:23.869
Tell me what he said.

01:24:24.919 --> 01:24:25.819
That is..

01:24:28.449 --> 01:24:30.319
He told me that you
went to the beach.

01:24:30.829 --> 01:24:31.649
Oh!

01:24:32.199 --> 01:24:33.989
Did he tell you that
we went to the beach?

01:24:34.449 --> 01:24:36.719
Yes, he also told me
about the hug, this idiot.

01:24:36.969 --> 01:24:38.239
I don't mind it.

01:24:39.809 --> 01:24:41.119
It's all a lie.

01:24:41.699 --> 01:24:43.899
Lie? It's a lie?

01:24:44.469 --> 01:24:45.529
You sinner.

01:24:46.069 --> 01:24:47.779
So where did you go
after the tea shop?

01:24:48.809 --> 01:24:50.439
I like it.
- Eat the rest.

01:24:50.689 --> 01:24:51.899
You will like everything.

01:24:52.269 --> 01:24:55.159
I didn't say that.
I said that I like your lifestyle.

01:25:02.389 --> 01:25:05.069
Reena, if you are okay..

01:25:05.379 --> 01:25:06.529
Shall we go to the beach?

01:25:06.949 --> 01:25:08.869
No need.
Let's have tea and leave.

01:25:13.499 --> 01:25:15.489
You sinner..

01:25:15.819 --> 01:25:18.909
You took me for a fool
and spun such a long story.

01:25:19.449 --> 01:25:22.739
Leave him to me, I will take care
of him. You little.. Don't run!

01:25:28.089 --> 01:25:29.419
Play some channel, Divi.

01:25:29.729 --> 01:25:31.419
Everything is boring.

01:25:37.899 --> 01:25:39.069
Hey, go back to that channel.

01:25:46.359 --> 01:25:49.369
This year's Medical Legal Death
Investigator of the Year award

01:25:49.699 --> 01:25:54.039
goes to a man whose words
speak louder than words

01:25:54.239 --> 01:25:55.899
whose presence commends respect

01:25:56.229 --> 01:25:59.379
and whose name stands
for integrity and brilliance.

01:25:59.709 --> 01:26:03.339
We're proud to honour someone who
has not only excelled in his field

01:26:03.459 --> 01:26:06.739
but also set a shining example
for others to follow.

01:26:06.839 --> 01:26:09.589
Ladies and gentlemen, please put
your hands together to welcome

01:26:09.669 --> 01:26:11.389
Mr. Vijay to receive the award.

01:26:24.409 --> 01:26:25.819
Congratulations, Dr. Vijay.

01:26:25.899 --> 01:26:27.219
It must have been a long journey.

01:26:27.299 --> 01:26:29.819
Could you please share how difficult
it was to reach this point?

01:26:31.819 --> 01:26:34.149
I'd like to speak in my
mother tongue, if that's okay.

01:26:34.239 --> 01:26:36.239
I'd like to speak from my heart.
- Sure.

01:26:37.739 --> 01:26:39.779
Since I love what I do

01:26:40.539 --> 01:26:43.299
I see all my efforts
as my hard work.

01:26:43.459 --> 01:26:44.589
I don't consider it difficult.

01:26:45.779 --> 01:26:48.029
I have come across many obstacles
in my journey but..

01:26:49.029 --> 01:26:54.489
There was something that prevented
me from feeling any of it.

01:26:55.029 --> 01:26:57.949
It was something inside me.
It's still there.

01:26:59.639 --> 01:27:00.639
A kind of pain.

01:27:01.429 --> 01:27:03.449
Pain?
Can we know more about it?

01:27:10.739 --> 01:27:15.029
There was something in my life
as unexpected as this award.

01:27:15.409 --> 01:27:16.399
Love.

01:27:17.159 --> 01:27:20.199
I experienced a rare
and beautiful love.

01:27:20.369 --> 01:27:21.889
That too, back in my school days.

01:27:22.829 --> 01:27:25.949
Not all relationships lead
to marriage and children.

01:27:26.299 --> 01:27:28.659
But just when I felt like

01:27:29.839 --> 01:27:30.839
I'd have it all..

01:27:33.029 --> 01:27:34.569
Very quickly..

01:27:35.509 --> 01:27:37.899
My relationship very quickly..

01:27:39.809 --> 01:27:41.629
I lost it in the blink of an eye.

01:27:41.729 --> 01:27:44.939
I think I still haven't

01:27:46.039 --> 01:27:48.029
moved on from it or the pain.

01:27:49.569 --> 01:27:54.359
I think the pain inside me
has pushed me so far.

01:27:54.409 --> 01:27:56.159
I think you got the answer
to your question.

01:27:56.409 --> 01:28:00.869
That pain is this award today.

01:28:02.489 --> 01:28:03.859
Thank you, Dr. Vijay.

01:28:04.749 --> 01:28:05.749
Who is he, Mom?

01:28:09.089 --> 01:28:12.089
I don't know. He looks like
a Medical Investigation Officer.

01:28:12.469 --> 01:28:15.869
Doesn't his story sound familiar?

01:28:20.349 --> 01:28:22.329
'Every time you
come in front of me'

01:28:22.459 --> 01:28:28.599
'I can't tell you how much
pain and heaviness I felt.'

01:28:28.689 --> 01:28:30.229
'If you can't tell me'

01:28:31.819 --> 01:28:32.999
'who else can I ask?'

01:28:33.089 --> 01:28:35.029
'There are many
people in the hospital.'

01:28:35.319 --> 01:28:37.489
'I want to dress up well.'

01:28:37.569 --> 01:28:41.119
'My hairstyle, my make-up,
everything should be superb.'

